/* Church & Trellis – words for Home's "What's new" and "Did you know?" card (js/tips.js, js/app.js tipsCard).
 * One line per text: [English, Afrikaans, isiZulu, isiXhosa]. Keep every {…} part as it is. Test: node tests/i18n.test.js */
I18n.rows([
    ['Administrators and Pastors now have a Usage page: how many people use Church & Trellis, who is on right now, how much each person uses it, and which parts are used most.', 'Administrateurs en Pastore het nou ’n Gebruik-bladsy: hoeveel mense Church & Trellis gebruik, wie nou aanlyn is, hoeveel elke persoon dit gebruik, en watter dele die meeste gebruik word.', 'Abaphathi nabafundisi manje banekhasi le-Ukusetshenziswa: bangaki abantu abasebenzisa i-Church & Trellis, ngubani osebenzisa manje, ukuthi umuntu ngamunye uyisebenzisa kangakanani, nokuthi iziphi izingxenye ezisetshenziswa kakhulu.', 'Abalawuli nabefundisi ngoku banephepha le-Ukusetyenziswa: bangaphi abantu abasebenzisa i-Church & Trellis, ngubani osebenzisa ngoku, ukuba umntu ngamnye uyisebenzisa kangakanani, nokuba zeziphi iinxalenye ezisetyenziswa kakhulu.'],
    ['Edit details now suggests a spouse or partner from the person’s household (or the same surname) – tap their name to choose them.', 'Wysig besonderhede stel nou ’n eggenoot of lewensmaat voor uit die persoon se huishouding (of dieselfde van) – tik hul naam om hulle te kies.', 'Ukuhlela imininingwane manje kuphakamisa umlingani ovela emndenini womuntu (noma onesibongo esifanayo) – thinta igama lakhe ukumkhetha.', 'Ukuhlela iinkcukacha ngoku kucebisa iqabane elivela kwikhaya lomntu (okanye elifani efanayo) – cofa igama lalo ukulikhetha.'],
    ['Not known for an email or mobile is now a button beside the box – no more typing “unknown”.', 'Nie bekend nie vir ’n e-pos of selfoon is nou ’n knoppie langs die blokkie – nie meer “onbekend” tik nie.', 'Akwaziwa ku-imeyili noma kuselula manje kuyinkinobho eceleni kwebhokisi – akusabhaleki “akwaziwa”.', 'Akwaziwa kwi-imeyile okanye kwiselfowuni ngoku liqhosha elikufuphi nebhokisi – akusafuneki uchwetheze “akwaziwa”.'],
    ['When you add or edit someone, a Not known button saves typing when an email or cell number isn’t known, Care Groups can be found by typing, and anything that needs fixing now pops up in a friendly card.', 'Wanneer jy iemand byvoeg of wysig, spaar ’n Nie bekend nie-knoppie tikwerk as ’n e-pos of selnommer nie bekend is, selgroepe kan getik word om te soek, en alles wat reggemaak moet word, verskyn nou in ’n vriendelike kaart.', 'Uma ufaka noma uhlela umuntu, inkinobho ethi Akwaziwa isindisa ukuthayipha uma i-imeyili noma inombolo yeselula ingaziwa, amaqembu okunakekelana angatholakala ngokuthayipha, futhi noma yini edinga ukulungiswa manje iphuma ekhadini elinomusa.', 'Xa ufaka okanye uhlela umntu, iqhosha elithi Akwaziwa lisindisa ukuchwetheza xa i-imeyile okanye inombolo yeselula ingaziwa, amaqela okukhathalelana anokufunyanwa ngokuchwetheza, kwaye nantoni na efuna ukulungiswa ngoku iphuma kwikhadi elinobubele.'],
    ["Library: Items I have borrowed now shows each book’s cover picture beside its title.", "Biblioteek: Items wat ek geleen het wys nou elke boek se omslagprent langs sy titel.", "Umtapo wezincwadi: Izinto engizibolekile manje ibonisa isithombe sekhava yeso sonke incwadi eduze nesihloko sayo.", "Ithala leencwadi: Izinto endizibolekileyo ngoku ibonisa umfanekiso wekhava yeyonke incwadi ecaleni kwesihloko sayo."],
    ["Edit details is now the big button at the top of a person’s page, and a home address can carry a Google Maps Plus Code that anyone can tap to go straight to the spot.", "Wysig besonderhede is nou die groot knoppie bo-aan ’n persoon se bladsy, en ’n huisadres kan ’n Google Maps Plus Code hê wat enigiemand kan aanraak om reguit na die plek te gaan.", "Hlela imininingwane manje inkinobho enkulu phezulu ekhasini lomuntu, futhi ikheli lasekhaya lingaba ne-Plus Code ye-Google Maps ongayithinta uye ngqo lapho.", "Hlela iinkcukacha ngoku yiqhosha elikhulu ngaphezulu kwiphepha lomntu, kwaye idilesi yekhaya inokuba neePlus Code zeGoogle Maps ongayichukumisa uye ngqo apho."],
    ["New: Me → Appearance. Everyone can now choose their own colour and page pictures (soft watercolour, warm line art or plain) – only you see them, on this device – and go back to the church’s theme at any time.", "Nuut: Ek → Voorkoms. Almal kan nou hul eie kleur en bladsyprente kies (sagte waterverf, warm lyntekeninge of gewoon) – net jy sien dit, op hierdie toestel – en enige tyd terugkeer na die kerk se tema.", "Okusha: Mina → Ukubukeka. Wonke umuntu manje angakhetha umbala wakhe nezithombe zamakhasi (i-watercolour ethambile, imidwebo yemigqa ephakeme noma ejwayelekile) – nguwe kuphela ozibonayo, kule divayisi – futhi ungabuyela esindikimbeni sebandla noma inini.", "Entsha: Mna → Inkangeleko. Wonke umntu ngoku unokukhetha umbala wakhe neziqinisekiso zamaphepha (i-watercolour ethambileyo, imizobo yemigca eshushu okanye eqhelekileyo) – nguwe kuphela ozibonayo, kule ndlela – kwaye ungabuyela kwithimba lecawa nanini na."],
    ["Every page now has a soft watercolour picture at the top. Administrators and the Rector can choose warm line art instead, or go back to plain, under Settings → Appearance → Page pictures.", "Elke bladsy het nou ’n sagte waterverf-prent bo-aan. Administrateurs en die Rektor kan eerder warm lynkuns kies, of terugskakel na gewoon, onder Instellings → Voorkoms → Bladsyprentjies.", "Wonke ikhasi manje line-thombe se-watercolour esithambile phezulu. Abaphathi noMfundisi bangakhetha imidwebo yemigqa efudumele esikhundleni, noma babuyele ekuvamile, ngaphansi kuka-Izilungiselelo → Ukubukeka → Izithombe zamakhasi.", "Lonke iphepha ngoku linomfanekiso othambileyo we-watercolour phezulu. Abalawuli kunye noMfundisi banokukhetha imizobo yemigca efudumeleyo endaweni yoko, okanye babuyele kokuqhelekileyo, kwiiSetingi → Inkangeleko → Imifanekiso yamaphepha."],
    ["On each of your turns on Me → Serving you can now see who else is serving at that service – names and jobs, your own team first.", "By elk van jou beurte op Ek → Dien kan jy nou sien wie anders by daardie diens dien – name en take, jou eie span eerste.", "Ethubeni ngalinye lakho ku-Mina → Ukukhonza manje ungabona abanye abakhonza kuleyo nkonzo – amagama nemisebenzi, ithimba lakho kuqala.", "Kwithuba ngalinye lakho ku-Mna → Ukukhonza ngoku ungabona abanye abakhonza kuloo nkonzo – amagama nemisebenzi, iqela lakho kuqala."],
    ["Can’t make a turn? Tap Can’t make it and you can ask someone on your team who is free that day to take your place – they answer with one tap, and the roster team is told.", "Kan jy nie ’n beurt doen nie? Tik op Kan nie kom nie, en jy kan iemand in jou span wat daardie dag vry is vra om jou plek in te neem – hulle antwoord met een tik, en die roosterspan word ingelig.", "Awukwazi ukwenza ithuba lakho? Thepha Ngeke ngikwazi, bese ucela othile ethimbeni lakho okhululekile ngalolo suku ukuba athathe indawo yakho – baphendula ngokuthepha kanye, futhi ithimba lohlelo liyaziswa.", "Awukwazi ukwenza ithuba lakho? Cofa Andizukukwazi, uze ucele othile kwiqela lakho okhululekileyo ngaloo mini ukuba athathe indawo yakho – baphendula ngokucofa kanye, kwaye iqela loludwe liyaziswa."],
    ["Before a new term’s roster is made, you may be asked whether you’ll be away: add your days away, or tap I’m free. And you can now choose to serve once a quarter, or take a break without leaving the team.", "Voordat ’n nuwe kwartaal se rooster gemaak word, kan jy gevra word of jy weg sal wees: voeg jou dae weg by, of tik op Ek is vry. En jy kan nou kies om een keer ’n kwartaal te dien, of ’n blaaskans te vat sonder om die span te verlaat.", "Ngaphambi kokuthi kwenziwe uhlelo lwekota entsha, ungabuzwa ukuthi uzobe ungekho yini: faka izinsuku ongekho ngazo, noma uthephe Ngikhululekile. Futhi manje ungakhetha ukukhonza kanye ngekota, noma uphumule ngaphandle kokushiya ithimba.", "Phambi kokuba kwenziwe uludwe lwekota entsha, unokubuzwa ukuba uza kungabikho na: yongeza iintsuku ongekho ngazo, okanye ucofe Ndikhululekile. Kwaye ngoku ungakhetha ukukhonza kanye ngekota, okanye uphumle ngaphandle kokushiya iqela."],
    ["Before filling a new term: Rosters → More → Ask who’s away… asks every volunteer to add their days away or say they’re free, and the roster shows who has answered, with Remind the others.", "Voordat jy ’n nuwe kwartaal invul: Roosters → Meer → Vra wie weg is… vra elke vrywilliger om hul dae weg by te voeg of te sê hulle is vry, en die rooster wys wie geantwoord het, met Herinner die ander.", "Ngaphambi kokugcwalisa ikota entsha: Uhlelo lokusebenza → Okunye → Buza ukuthi ubani ongekho… ibuza wonke amavolontiya ukuthi afake izinsuku angekho ngazo noma athi akhululekile, futhi uhlelo lubonisa abaphendulile, kanye no-Khumbuza abanye.", "Phambi kokuzalisa ikota entsha: Uludwe lomsebenzi → Okunye → Buza ukuba ngubani ongekhoyo… ibuza onke amavolontiya ukuba ongeze iintsuku angekho ngazo okanye athi akhululekile, kwaye uludwe lubonisa abaphendulileyo, kunye no-Khumbuza abanye."],
    ["All your serving is now in one place: Me → Serving. It shows your turns to answer, each position you serve in with its services (8am, 10am, 5pm), your days away and who you serve with.", "Al jou diens is nou op een plek: Ek → Dien. Dit wys die beurte wat jy moet beantwoord, elke posisie waarin jy dien met sy dienste (8vm., 10vm., 5nm.), jou dae weg en saam met wie jy dien.", "Konke ukukhonza kwakho manje kusendaweni eyodwa: Mina → Ukukhonza. Kubonisa amathuba okufanele uwaphendule, isikhundla ngasinye okhonza kuso nezinkonzo zaso (8am, 10am, 5pm), izinsuku ongekho ngazo nokuthi ukhonza nobani.", "Konke ukukhonza kwakho ngoku kukwindawo enye: Mna → Ukukhonza. Kubonisa amathuba ekufuneka uwaphendule, isikhundla ngasinye okhonza kuso neenkonzo zaso (8am, 10am, 5pm), iintsuku ongekho ngazo nokuba ukhonza nabani."],
    ["Rosters → Teams now shows the services each position is needed at, and how many can serve any week, once a month or as a backup. Tap 8am, 10am or 5pm to see only that service’s teams.", "Roosters → Spanne wys nou die dienste waar elke posisie nodig is, en hoeveel enige week, een keer ’n maand of as rugsteun kan dien. Tik op 8vm., 10vm. of 5nm. om net daardie diens se spanne te sien.", "Uhlelo → Amathimba manje lubonisa izinkonzo isikhundla ngasinye esidingeka kuzo, nokuthi bangaki abangakhonza noma yiliphi isonto, kanye ngenyanga noma njengabasekeli. Thepha u-8am, 10am noma 5pm ukuze ubone amathimba aleyo nkonzo kuphela.", "Uludwe → Amaqela omsebenzi ngoku lubonisa iinkonzo isikhundla ngasinye esifuneka kuzo, nokuba bangaphi abanokukhonza nayiphi na iveki, kanye ngenyanga okanye njengabaxhasi. Cofa u-8am, 10am okanye 5pm ukuze ubone amaqela aloo nkonzo kuphela."],
    ["Easier to read: on your own page your details now come first and your groups last, headings are a little bigger, and the main buttons are a softer orange on every page.", "Makliker om te lees: op jou eie bladsy kom jou besonderhede eerste en jou groepe laaste, opskrifte is ’n bietjie groter, en die hoofknoppies is op elke bladsy ’n sagter oranje.", "Kulula ukufunda: ekhasini lakho siqu, imininingwane yakho iza kuqala namaqembu akho aze ngokugcina, izihloko zinkulu kancane, futhi izinkinobho eziyinhloko zimbala ose-orange ohlwabusayo kuwo wonke amakhasi.", "Kulula ukufunda: kwiphepha lakho, iinkcukacha zakho ziza kuqala kwaye amaqela akho aze ekugqibeleni, izihloko zikhulu kancinane, kwaye amaqhosha aphambili ayi-orenji ethambileyo kwamanye onke amaphepha."],
    ["In Did you know? and What’s new, the names of buttons and menu items now look like little buttons, so it is easy to see what to tap.", "In Het jy geweet? en Wat is nuut lyk die name van knoppies en kieslysitems nou soos klein knoppies, sodat dit maklik is om te sien waarop om te tik.", "Ku-Ubuwazi? nakokuthi Okusha, amagama ezinkinobho nezinto zemenyu manje abukeka njengezinkinobho ezincane, ukuze kube lula ukubona okufanele ukuthinte.", "Kuthi Ubusazi? nakuthi Okutsha, amagama amaqhosha nezinto zemenyu ngoku abonakala njengamaqhosha amancinane, ukuze kube lula ukubona into ekufuneka uyicofe."],
    ["Rosters → Teams: the Administrator, the Rector and the assistant ministers can now write a position’s tooltip, and a new position is added in one box. On a phone, tap the small i beside a position to read its tooltip.", "Roosters → Spanne: die Administrateur, die Rektor en die assistent-predikante kan nou ’n posisie se tooltip skryf, en ’n nuwe posisie word in een blokkie bygevoeg. Tik op ’n foon die klein i langs ’n posisie om sy tooltip te lees.", "Rosters → Amaqembu: uMlawuli, i-Rector nabefundisi abasizayo manje bangabhala i-tooltip yesikhundla, futhi isikhundla esisha sengezwa ebhokisini elilodwa. Efonini, thepha i-i encane eduze kwesikhundla ukuze ufunde i-tooltip yaso.", "Rosters → Amaqela: uMlawuli, i-Rector nabefundisi abanceda ngoku banokubhala i-tooltip yesikhundla, kwaye isikhundla esitsha songezwa kwibhokisi enye. Kwifowuni, cofa i-i encinci ecaleni kwesikhundla ukuze ufunde i-tooltip yaso."],
    ["Archives look much friendlier: each folder is a coloured tile, documents show what kind of file they are with Preview and Download beside them, you always see where you are, and the newest documents are on the first page.", "Die Argiewe lyk nou baie vriendeliker: elke vouer is ’n gekleurde teël, dokumente wys watter soort lêer dit is met Voorskou en Laai af langsaan, jy sien altyd waar jy is, en die nuutste dokumente is op die eerste bladsy.", "Izingobo zomlando zibukeka zinobungani kakhulu: ifolda ngayinye iyithayela elinombala, amadokhumenti abonisa uhlobo lwefayela anakho Buka kuqala noThatha eceleni, njalo ubona lapho ukhona, futhi amadokhumenti amasha asekhasini lokuqala.", "Oovimba beerekhodi bubukeka bubahlobo kakhulu: ifolda nganye yitayile enombala, amaxwebhu abonisa uhlobo lwefayile aneKhangela kuqala neKhuphela ecaleni, ihlala ibona apho ukhoyo, yaye amaxwebhu amatsha asekhasini lokuqala."],
    ["Rosters → Teams: a position that was added by mistake, or isn’t used any more, can now be deleted (⋯ beside it). Each position’s names fold away until you tap them, and its tooltip is set from the same ⋯ menu.", "Roosters → Spanne: ’n posisie wat per fout bygevoeg is, of nie meer gebruik word nie, kan nou geskrap word (⋯ langsaan). Elke posisie se name vou weg totdat jy daarop tik, en sy tooltip word uit dieselfde ⋯-kieslys gestel.", "Rosters → Amaqembu: isikhundla esingeniswe ngephutha, noma esingasasetshenziswa, manje singasuswa (⋯ eduze kwaso). Amagama esikhundla ngasinye ayaphela uze uwathephe, kanti i-tooltip yaso isethwa kuleli kheli le-⋯.", "Rosters → Amaqela: isikhundla esongezwe ngempazamo, okanye esingasasetyenziswa, ngoku sinokucinywa (⋯ ecaleni kwaso). Amagama esikhundla ngasinye ayafihla de uwacofe, kwaye i-tooltip yaso isetwa kule menyu ye-⋯."],
    ["Events: print everyone who has signed up, with their cellphone numbers – or save it as a PDF. Events → More → Sign-up report, or Print on an event.", "Geleenthede: druk almal wat ingeskryf het, met hul selfoonnommers – of stoor dit as ’n PDF. Geleenthede → Meer → Inskrywingsverslag, of Druk by ’n geleentheid.", "Imicimbi: phrinta bonke ababhalisile, nezinombolo zabo zamaselula – noma uyigcine njenge-PDF. Imicimbi → Okunye → Umbiko wokubhalisa, noma Phrinta emcimbini.", "Imisitho: shicilela bonke ababhalisileyo, neenombolo zabo zeeselula – okanye uyigcine njenge-PDF. Imisitho → Okunye → Ingxelo yokubhalisa, okanye Printa kumsitho."],
    ["Events: anyone on the staff can now add people to an event – for those who put their name down on a sheet. Open the event and tap Add people under Who’s coming.", "Geleenthede: enigiemand op die personeel kan nou mense by ’n geleentheid voeg – vir dié wat hul naam op ’n lys geskryf het. Maak die geleentheid oop en tik Voeg mense by onder Wie kom.", "Imicimbi: noma ubani osebenzini manje angengeza abantu emcimbini – kulabo ababhale amagama abo ephepheni. Vula umcimbi bese uthepha Engeza abantu ngaphansi kokuthi Ubani oza.", "Imisitho: nabani na kubasebenzi ngoku angongeza abantu kumsitho – kwabo babhale amagama abo ephepheni. Vula umsitho uze ucofe Yongeza abantu phantsi kokuthi Ngubani oza."],
    ["New: Events. Switch it on under Settings → Apps. Put events up, see who’s coming and write to them all; people sign up with one tap and are reminded 3 days and 1 day before – in Messages, and by email if they like.", "Nuut: Geleenthede. Skakel dit aan onder Instellings → Toepassings. Plaas geleenthede, sien wie kom en skryf aan almal; mense skryf met een tik in en word 3 dae en 1 dag vooraf herinner – in Boodskappe, en per e-pos as hulle wil.", "Okusha: Imicimbi. Kuvule ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo → Izinhlelo. Faka imicimbi, ubone abezayo futhi ubabhalele bonke; abantu babhalisa ngokuthepha kanye futhi bakhunjuzwa ezinsukwini ezi-3 nosuku olu-1 ngaphambili – kuMilayezo, nangeimeyili uma bethanda.", "Okutsha: Imisitho. Kuvule phantsi kwe-Iisetingi → Iiapps. Faka imisitho, ubone abazayo uze ubabhalele bonke; abantu babhalisa ngokucofa kube kanye baze bakhunjuzwe kwiintsuku ezi-3 nosuku olu-1 ngaphambili – kwiMiyalezo, nangeimeyile ukuba bayathanda."],
    ["Events are here: see what’s coming up, tap I’ll be there, and we’ll remind you 3 days and 1 day before.", "Geleenthede is hier: sien wat voorlê, tik Ek sal daar wees, en ons herinner jou 3 dae en 1 dag vooraf.", "Imicimbi isifikile: bona okuzayo, thepha Ngizoba khona, futhi sizokukhumbuza ezinsukwini ezi-3 nosuku olu-1 ngaphambili.", "Imisitho ifikile: jonga okuzayo, cofa Ndiza kubakhona, kwaye siza kukukhumbuza kwiintsuku ezi-3 nosuku olu-1 ngaphambili."],
    ["Signed up for an event? Open it and tap Add to my calendar – your phone reminds you too.", "Ingeskryf vir ’n geleentheid? Maak dit oop en tik Voeg by my kalender – jou foon herinner jou ook.", "Ubhalisele umcimbi? Wuvule bese uthepha Engeza ekhalendeni yami – ifoni yakho izokukhumbuza nayo.", "Ubhalisele umsitho? Wuvule uze ucofe Yongeza kwikhalenda yam – ifowuni yakho iya kukukhumbuza nayo."],
    ["Rosters on a phone: the roster now shows two or three services side by side instead of just one – swipe sideways to see more, or use the arrows either side of the date.", "Roosters op ’n foon: die rooster wys nou twee of drie dienste langs mekaar in plaas van net een – swiep opsy om meer te sien, of gebruik die pyltjies weerskante van die datum.", "Uhlelo lokusebenza efonini: uhlelo manje lubonisa izinkonzo ezimbili noma ezintathu eduze komunye kunokuba kube eyodwa kuphela – shelelisa uye eceleni ukuze ubone ezinye, noma sebenzisa imicibisholo eceleni kosuku.", "Uludwe lwemisebenzi kwifowuni: ngoku lubonisa iinkonzo ezimbini okanye ezintathu ecaleni komnye endaweni yenye kuphela – tyibilikisa usiya ecaleni ukuze ubone ezinye, okanye sebenzisa iintolo ezisecaleni komhla."],
    ["Rosters: anyone can now print or download the whole roster as a PDF – portrait or landscape, for a month up to a year, with the positions down the side and every Sunday across the top. A Sunday with no service stays as a column and says so. Rosters → My serving → Print or download the roster (planners: More).", "Almal kan nou die hele rooster as ’n PDF druk of aflaai – regop of dwars, vir ’n maand tot ’n jaar, met die poste af die kant en elke Sondag bo oor. ’n Sondag sonder diens bly as ’n kolom staan en sê so. Roosters → My diens → Druk of laai die rooster af (beplanners: Meer).", "Wonke umuntu manje angaphrinta noma alande uhlelo lonke njenge-PDF – lume mpo noma lelele, kusuka enyangeni eyodwa kuye onyakeni, izikhundla eceleni nawo wonke amaSonto phezulu. ISonto elingenayo inkonzo lihlala njengekholomu futhi lisho njalo. Uhlelo lokusebenza → Ukukhonza kwami → Phrinta noma ulande uhlelo (abahleli: Okunye).", "Wonke umntu ngoku unokuprinta okanye akhuphele lonke uludwe njenge-PDF – lime nkqo okanye lilathe, ukusuka kwinyanga enye ukuya kunyaka, neendawo ecaleni neeCawa zonke ngaphezulu. ICawa engenayo inkonzo ihlala njengekholamu kwaye ibonisa oko. Uludwe lomsebenzi → Ukukhonza kwam → Printa okanye ukhuphele uludwe (abayilayo: Okunye)."],
    ["Print the roster a term at a time on A4: each service gets its own page, showing only the positions with names on them. Rosters → More → Print the roster (Pastors: on My serving). Choose “Save as PDF” to make a PDF.", "Druk die rooster ’n kwartaal op ’n slag op A4: elke diens kry sy eie bladsy, met net die poste waarop name staan. Roosters → Meer → Druk die rooster (Pastore: op My diens). Kies “Save as PDF” om ’n PDF te maak.", "Phrinta uhlelo ithemu ngalinye ku-A4: inkonzo ngayinye ithola ikhasi layo, ibonisa kuphela izikhundla ezinamagama. Uhlelo → Okunye → Phrinta uhlelo (Abefundisi: ku-Ukusebenza kwami). Khetha “Save as PDF” ukuze wenze i-PDF.", "Printa uludwe ikota nganye kwi-A4: inkonzo nganye ifumana iphepha layo, ibonisa kuphela izikhundla ezinamagama. Uludwe → Okunye → Printa uludwe (Abefundisi: kuMsebenzi wam). Khetha “Save as PDF” ukwenza i-PDF."],
    ["Names are now listed from A to Z in Rosters (teams and serving groups), Groups, the Librarians, the keepers and Privacy – tap a name to open the person’s page.", "Name word nou van A tot Z gelys in Roosters (spanne en dienegroepe), Groepe, die Biblioteekarisse, die bewaarders en Privaatheid – tik op ’n naam om die persoon se bladsy oop te maak.", "Amagama manje abhalwe kusuka ku-A kuya ku-Z ohlelweni (amaqembu namaqembu okukhonza), kumaQembu, kubaphathi bomtapo wolwazi, kubagcini nakuBumfihlo – thepha igama ukuvula ikhasi lomuntu.", "Amagama ngoku adweliswe ukusuka ku-A ukuya ku-Z kuludwe (amaqela namaqela okukhonza), kumaQela, kubagcini bethala leencwadi, kubagcini nakuBumfihlo – cofa igama ukuvula iphepha lomntu."],
    ["Subscription: a church that gives monthly can now take a payment holiday whenever it needs one, no questions asked (a yearly church switches to monthly first), and paying is moving to PayFast – card, Instant EFT or SnapScan – with no bank details shown.", "Intekening: ’n kerk wat maandeliks gee, kan nou ’n betalingsvakansie neem wanneer dit een nodig het, sonder vrae (’n kerk wat jaarliks betaal, skakel eers oor na maandeliks), en betaling skuif na PayFast – kaart, Kits-EFT of SnapScan – sonder dat enige bankbesonderhede gewys word.", "Ukubhalisa: isonto elinikela njalo ngenyanga manje lingathatha ikhefu lokukhokha noma nini lapho lilidinga, ngaphandle kwemibuzo (isonto elikhokha ngonyaka liqala lishintshele enyangeni), futhi ukukhokha kudlulela ku-PayFast – ngekhadi, nge-EFT esheshayo noma nge-SnapScan – kungaboniswa imininingwane yasebhange.", "Umrhumo: icawe enikela rhoqo ngenyanga ngoku ingathatha ikhefu lokuhlawula nanini na xa ilifuna, ngaphandle kwemibuzo (icawe ehlawula ngonyaka iqala itshintshele kwinyanga), kwaye ukuhlawula kufudukela kwi-PayFast – ngekhadi, nge-EFT ekhawulezayo okanye nge-SnapScan – kungaboniswa iinkcukacha zebhanki."],
    ["Church Hub has a new name: Church & Trellis. Everything works as before, and nothing you have saved has changed.", "Church Hub het ’n nuwe naam: Church & Trellis. Alles werk soos voorheen, en niks wat jy gestoor het, het verander nie.", "I-Church Hub inegama elisha: i-Church & Trellis. Konke kusebenza njengakuqala, futhi akukho okugcinile okushintshile.", "I-Church Hub inegama elitsha: i-Church & Trellis. Yonke into isebenza njengangaphambili, kwaye akukho nto uyigcinileyo itshintshileyo."],
    ["Rosters now open with as many services as fit your screen. Use − and + to see from 1 to 16 side by side, or choose 1 month or 1 quarter and slide across.", "Roosters maak nou oop met soveel dienste as wat op jou skerm pas. Gebruik − en + om 1 tot 16 langs mekaar te sien, of kies 1 maand of 1 kwartaal en skuif dwars.", "Ama-roster manje avuleka nezinkonzo eziningi ngangokulingana nesikrini sakho. Sebenzisa − no-+ ukubona ezisuka ku-1 kuya ku-16 eceleni kwazo, noma ukhethe inyanga e-1 noma ikota e-1 bese ushelelisa uye eceleni.", "Ii-roster ngoku zivuleka neenkonzo ezininzi ngokulingana nesikrini sakho. Sebenzisa − no-+ ukubona ezisuka ku-1 ukuya ku-16 ecaleni kwazo, okanye ukhethe inyanga e-1 okanye ikota e-1 uze utyibilikise usiya ecaleni."],
    ["Midweek Groups: every group leader can now add anyone to their group with “Add someone to the group”, people who only come to church too – they see just each person’s name.", "Midweekse groepe: elke groepleier kan nou enigiemand met “Voeg iemand by die groep” by hulle groep voeg, ook mense wat net kerk toe kom – hulle sien net elke persoon se naam.", "AmaQembu aphakathi nesonto: wonke umholi weqembu manje angengeza noma ubani eqenjini lakhe nge-“Engeza umuntu eqenjini”, ngisho nabantu abeza esontweni nje – abona igama lomuntu kuphela.", "AmaQela aphakathi evekini: yonke inkokeli yeqela ngoku ingongeza nabani na kwiqela layo nge-“Yongeza umntu eqeleni”, kwanabantu abeza ecaweni nje – ibona igama lomntu kuphela."],
    ["Every week, Home now shows a different church to pray for – the same one for everyone at your church that week, so you can pray for it together on Sunday.", "Elke week wys Tuis nou ’n ander kerk om voor te bid – dieselfde een vir almal in julle kerk daardie week, sodat julle Sondag saam daarvoor kan bid.", "Njalo ngeviki, ikhasi Lasekhaya manje likhombisa isonto elihlukile lokuthandazela – elifanayo kubo bonke esontweni lakho kulelo viki, ukuze nilithandazele ndawonye ngeSonto.", "Rhoqo ngeveki, iKhaya ngoku libonisa icawe eyahlukileyo yokuthandazela – enye kubo bonke ecaweni yakho kuloo veki, ukuze niyithandazele kunye ngeCawa."],
    ["Administrators: every church now keeps a prayer card and looks at it once a month – Home reminds you. A paying church can turn off the weekly prayer card under Subscription → Churches to pray for.", "Administrateurs: elke kerk hou nou ’n gebedskaart en kyk een keer per maand daarna – Tuis herinner julle. ’n Kerk wat betaal, kan die weeklikse gebedskaart afskakel onder Intekening → Kerke om voor te bid.", "Abaphathi: wonke amasonto manje anekhadi lomthandazo futhi alibheka kanye ngenyanga – ikhasi Lasekhaya liyanikhumbuza. Isonto elikhokhayo lingacisha ikhadi lomthandazo lamaviki onke ngaphansi kokuthi Ukubhalisa → Amasonto okuthandazela.", "Abalawuli: zonke iicawe ngoku zinekhadi lomthandazo kwaye zilijonga kanye ngenyanga – iKhaya liyanikhumbuza. Icawe ehlawulayo ingacima ikhadi lomthandazo leveki nganye phantsi koMrhumo → Iicawe zokuthandazela."],
    ["Midweek Groups: when a Pastor or Administrator who leads a group uses “Add someone to the group”, they can now choose anyone, not only people in the church directory – the same as from a person’s page.", "Midweekse groepe: wanneer ’n Pastoor of Administrateur wat ’n groep lei “Voeg iemand by die groep” gebruik, kan hulle nou enigiemand kies, nie net mense in die kerkgids nie – net soos van ’n persoon se bladsy af.", "AmaQembu aphakathi nesonto: uma uMfundisi noma uMlawuli ohola iqembu esebenzisa “Engeza umuntu eqenjini”, manje angakhetha noma ubani, hhayi abantu abasohlwini lwesonto kuphela – njengasekhasini lomuntu.", "AmaQela aphakathi evekini: xa uMfundisi okanye uMlawuli okhokela iqela esebenzisa “Yongeza umntu eqeleni”, ngoku angakhetha nabani na, kungekuphela nje abantu abakuludwe lwecawa – njengakwiphepha lomntu."],
    ["Rosters: choose how many services to see side by side, from 2 to 8, and the top row (date, time and communion) stays in view as you scroll down.", "Roosters: kies hoeveel dienste jy langs mekaar wil sien, van 2 tot 8, en die boonste ry (datum, tyd en nagmaal) bly sigbaar terwyl jy afrol.", "Uhlelo: khetha ukuthi zingaki izinkonzo ofuna ukuzibona eceleni kwazo, kusuka ku-2 kuya ku-8, futhi umugqa ophezulu (usuku, isikhathi nesidlo seNkosi) uhlala ubonakala lapho uskrolela phansi.", "Uludwe: khetha ukuba zingaphi iinkonzo ofuna ukuzibona ecaleni kwazo, ukusuka ku-2 ukuya ku-8, kwaye umgca ophezulu (umhla, ixesha nesidlo seNkosi) uhlala ubonakala xa usehla."],
    ["Rosters: six services side by side with a slider to move across, an eye to hide a service for now, and departments can be put in order or joined together (Teams → ↑ ↓ and ⋯).", "Roosters: ses dienste langs mekaar met ’n skuifbalk om oor te beweeg, ’n oog om ’n diens vir eers te versteek, en departemente kan in volgorde gesit of saamgevoeg word (Spanne → ↑ ↓ en ⋯).", "Uhlelo: izinkonzo eziyisithupha eceleni kwazo ngesishelelisi sokudlula, iso lokufihla inkonzo okwamanje, futhi iminyango ingahlelwa ngokulandelana noma ihlanganiswe (Amaqembu → ↑ ↓ ne-⋯).", "Uludwe: iinkonzo ezintandathu ecaleni kwazo ngesityibilikisi sokuhamba, iliso lokufihla inkonzo okwangoku, kwaye amasebe angalandelaniswa okanye adityaniswe (Amaqela → ↑ ↓ kunye ne-⋯)."],
    ["Archives: a document you add now shows in its folder straight away, and the Senior Pastor sees staff contracts and appraisals again.", "Argiewe: ’n dokument wat jy byvoeg, wys nou dadelik in sy vouer, en die Senior Pastoor sien weer personeelkontrakte en evaluerings.", "Ama-Archive: idokhumenti oyengezayo manje ivela ngokushesha kufolda yayo, futhi uMfundisi Omkhulu uphinde abone izinkontileka nokuhlolwa kwabasebenzi.", "Ii-Archive: uxwebhu olongezayo ngoku luvela kwangoko kwifolda yalo, kwaye uMfundisi Omkhulu uphinda abone iikhontrakthi kunye novavanyo lwabasebenzi."],
    ["The Senior Pastor can now open the brochures under About, and print them or save them as a PDF.", "Die Senior Pastoor kan nou die brosjures onder Oor oopmaak, en dit druk of as ’n PDF stoor.", "UMfundisi Omkhulu manje angavula amabhroshua ngaphansi kokuthi Mayelana, futhi awaphrinte noma awagcine njenge-PDF.", "UMfundisi Omkhulu ngoku unokuvula iincwadana phantsi kokuthi Malunga, aze aziprinte okanye azigcine njenge-PDF."],
    ["Archives now has folders: Council meetings sort themselves into years and months by date, and Church & Trellis shows where a document will go – and asks if its date looks wrong – before saving.", "Argiewe het nou vouers: Kerkraadsvergaderings sorteer hulself volgens datum in jare en maande, en Church & Trellis wys waar ’n dokument gaan – en vra as sy datum verkeerd lyk – voordat dit gestoor word.", "Izingobo zomlando manje zinamafolda: Imihlangano yomkhandlu izihlela ngokwayo ngeminyaka nangezinyanga ngokosuku, futhi i-Church & Trellis ikhombisa ukuthi idokhumenti izoya kuphi – futhi ibuze uma usuku lwayo lubukeka lungalungile – ngaphambi kokuyigcina.", "Oovimba beerekhodi ngoku baneefolda: Iintlanganiso zebhunga ziyazicwangcisa ngeminyaka nangeenyanga ngokomhla, kwaye i-Church & Trellis ibonisa apho uxwebhu luza kuya khona – kwaye ibuze xa umhla walo ubonakala ungachanekanga – phambi kokulugcina."],
    ["Searching the Archives looks through every folder at once, and shows where each document is filed.", "Om in die Argiewe te soek, kyk deur elke vouer gelyk, en wys waar elke dokument geliasseer is.", "Ukusesha ezingobeni zomlando kubheka kuwo wonke amafolda ngesikhathi esisodwa, futhi kukhombise ukuthi idokhumenti ngayinye ifakwe kuphi.", "Ukukhangela koovimba beerekhodi kujonga kuzo zonke iifolda ngaxeshanye, kwaye kubonise apho uxwebhu ngalunye lufakwe khona."],
    ["Rosters: choose a date beside Earlier and Later to jump straight to the services that need filling then.", "Roosters: kies ’n datum langs Vroeër en Later om reguit na die dienste te spring wat dan gevul moet word.", "Uhlelo lokusebenza: khetha usuku eduze ko-Ngaphambili no-Kamuva ukuze uye ngqo ezinkonzweni ezidinga ukugcwaliswa ngaleso sikhathi.", "Uludwe lomsebenzi: khetha umhla ecaleni kuka-Ngaphambili no-Kamva ukuze uye ngqo kwiinkonzo ezifuna ukugcwaliswa ngelo xesha."],
    ["Rosters → Teams: use − and + to choose how many people a position needs at each service, for example 2 on the sound desk.", "Roosters → Spanne: gebruik − en + om te kies hoeveel mense ’n posisie by elke diens nodig het, byvoorbeeld 2 by die klankbord.", "Uhlelo lokusebenza → Amaqembu: sebenzisa − no-+ ukukhetha ukuthi bangaki abantu isikhundla esibadingayo enkonzweni ngayinye, isibonelo 2 kudeski lomsindo.", "Uludwe lomsebenzi → Amaqela: sebenzisa − no-+ ukukhetha ukuba bangaphi abantu isikhundla esibafunayo kwinkonzo nganye, umzekelo 2 kwidesika yesandi."],
    ["Services are now shown in time order (8am, 10am, 5pm) and in their own colours on the roster, My serving and Settings.", "Dienste word nou in tydsorde gewys (8vm, 10vm, 5nm) en in hul eie kleure op die rooster, My diens en Instellings.", "Izinkonzo manje ziboniswa ngokulandelana kwesikhathi (8 ekuseni, 10 ekuseni, 5 ntambama) nangemibala yazo ohlelweni, ku-Ukusebenza kwami nakuZilungiselelo.", "Iinkonzo ngoku ziboniswa ngolandelelwano lwexesha (8 kusasa, 10 kusasa, 5 emva kwemini) nangemibala yazo kuludwe, kwi-Ukukhonza kwam nakwiiSetingi."],
    ["When someone applies to become a Church Partner, Administrators and Pastors now also get a message in Messages.", "Wanneer iemand aansoek doen om ’n Kerkvennoot te word, kry Administrateurs en Pastore nou ook ’n boodskap in Boodskappe.", "Uma othile efaka isicelo sokuba Ngumlingani Webandla, Abaphathi Nabefundisi manje bathola nomlayezo ku-Imilayezo.", "Xa umntu efaka isicelo sokuba Liqabane Lecawa, Abalawuli Nabefundisi ngoku bafumana nomyalezo kwi-Imiyalezo."],
    ["Rosters → Teams now offers a Verger, Ushers and Recorded Music, and Collection Servers and Communion Servers as two separate positions – tap Add them.", "Roosters → Spanne bied nou ’n Koster, Plekaanwysers en Opgeneemde musiek aan, en Kollektebedieners en Nagmaalbedieners as twee aparte posisies – tik Voeg hulle by.", "Uhlelo lokusebenza → Amaqembu manje linikeza Umgcini wesonto, Abahleli nomculo Oqoshiwe, kanye Nabaqoqi Beminikelo Nabasizi Besidlo Esingcwele njengezikhundla ezimbili ezihlukene – thepha u-Bengeze.", "Uludwe lomsebenzi → Amaqela ngoku linika Umgcini wecawa, Abalungiseleli nomculo Orekhodiweyo, kunye Nabaqokeleli Bomnikelo Nabancedisi Besidlo Esingcwele njengezikhundla ezimbini ezahlukeneyo – cofa u-Bongeze."],
    ["You can now drag the columns in Advanced search to put them in the order you want.", "Jy kan nou die kolomme in Gevorderde soektog sleep om hulle in die volgorde te sit wat jy wil hê.", "Manje ungahudula amakholamu ku-Ukusesha okuthuthukisiwe ukuze uwabeke ngokulandelana okufunayo.", "Ngoku unokurhuqa iikholam kuKhangelo oluphucukileyo ukuze uzibeke ngolandelelwano olufunayo."],
    ["Rosters now show only the departments and positions needed at the services you’re looking at.", "Roosters wys nou net die departemente en posisies wat nodig is by die dienste waarna jy kyk.", "Uhlelo lokusebenza manje lukhombisa kuphela iminyango nezikhundla ezidingekayo ezinkonzweni ozibukayo.", "Uludwe lomsebenzi ngoku lubonisa kuphela amasebe nezikhundla ezifunekayo kwiinkonzo ozijongileyo."],
    ["Rosters: tap a name and choose Change person to swap it in one go – the first person is told, and a message they haven’t opened is taken back.", "Roosters: tik op ’n naam en kies Verander persoon om dit in een keer om te ruil – die eerste persoon word laat weet, en ’n boodskap wat hulle nog nie oopgemaak het nie, word teruggetrek.", "Uhlelo lokusebenza: thepha igama bese ukhetha u-Shintsha umuntu ukuze ulishintshe kanye – umuntu wokuqala uyaziswa, futhi umlayezo angakawuvuli uyahoxiswa.", "Uludwe lomsebenzi: cofa igama uze ukhethe u-Tshintsha umntu ukuze ulitshintshe ngokukhawuleza – umntu wokuqala uyaziswa, kwaye umyalezo angekawuvuli uyarhoxiswa."],
    ["The Church & Trellis icon on your phone or computer now has the same thin cross as inside the app.", "Die Church & Trellis-ikoon op jou foon of rekenaar het nou dieselfde dun kruis as binne die toep.", "Isithonjana se-Church & Trellis ocingweni lwakho noma kukhompyutha manje sinesiphambano esincane esifanayo naleso esingaphakathi kohlelo.", "Umfanekiso we-Church & Trellis kwifowuni okanye kwikhompyutha yakho ngoku unomnqamlezo omncinci ofanayo nalowo ungaphakathi kwi-app."],
    ["Advanced search looks calmer: each filter has a small × to remove it, and one Add a filter button sits underneath.", "Gevorderde soektog lyk rustiger: elke filter het ’n klein × om dit te verwyder, en een Voeg ’n filter by-knoppie staan onderaan.", "Ukusesha okuthuthukisiwe sekubukeka kuzolile: isihlungi ngasinye sine-× encane yokusisusa, futhi inkinobho eyodwa ethi Engeza isihlungi ingezansi.", "Ukukhangela okuphucukileyo ngoku kubonakala kuzolile: isihluzi ngasinye sine-× encinci yokusisusa, kwaye iqhosha elinye elithi Yongeza isihluzi lingezantsi."],
    ["Library: if you have borrowed something, the Library now opens on Items I have borrowed; tap Library for the whole catalogue.", "Biblioteek: as jy iets geleen het, maak die Biblioteek nou oop by Items wat ek geleen het; tik Biblioteek vir die hele katalogus.", "Umtapo wezincwadi: uma ubolekile okuthile, uMtapo wezincwadi manje uvuleka ku-Izinto engizibolekile; thepha u-Umtapo wezincwadi ukuze ubone lonke uhlu.", "Ithala leencwadi: ukuba ubolekile into, iThala leencwadi ngoku livuleka kwi-Izinto endizibolekileyo; cofa uThala leencwadi ukuze ubone lonke uluhlu."],
    ["People: each field on a person’s page and in Edit details now has a small icon, so you can see at a glance what it asks.", "Mense: elke veld op ’n persoon se bladsy en in Wysig besonderhede het nou ’n klein ikoon, sodat jy dadelik sien wat dit vra.", "Abantu: inkambu ngayinye ekhasini lomuntu naku-Hlela imininingwane manje inesithonjana esincane, ukuze ubone ngokushesha ukuthi ibuzani.", "Abantu: intsimi nganye kwiphepha lomntu nakwi-Hlela iinkcukacha ngoku inomfanekiso omncinci, ukuze ubone ngoko nangoko ukuba ibuza ntoni."],
    ["Library: the items you have borrowed now have a tab of their own, before Library and Archives.", "Biblioteek: die items wat jy geleen het, het nou ’n eie oortjie, voor Biblioteek en Argiewe.", "Umtapo wezincwadi: izinto ozibolekile manje zinethebhu yazo, ngaphambi kwe-Umtapo wezincwadi ne-Izingobo zomlando.", "Ithala leencwadi: izinto ozibolekileyo ngoku zinethebhu yazo, phambi kwe-Ithala leencwadi ne-Oovimba beerekhodi."],
    ["Members with no email address can now sign in with their cellphone number and a PIN: the church office gives them a sign-in code once, and with it they choose their PIN.", "Lede sonder ’n e-posadres kan nou met hul selfoonnommer en ’n PIN aanmeld: die kerkkantoor gee hulle een keer ’n aanmeldkode, en daarmee kies hulle hul PIN.", "Amalungu angenalo ikheli le-imeyili manje angangena ngenombolo yawo yeselula ne-PIN: ihhovisi lesonto libanika ikhodi yokungena kanye, futhi ngayo bakhetha i-PIN yabo.", "Amalungu angenayo idilesi ye-imeyile ngoku angangena ngenombolo yawo yeselfowuni ne-PIN: iofisi yecawa ibanika ikhowudi yokungena kanye, kwaye ngayo bakhetha i-PIN yabo."],
    ["Administrators: give a member with no email a sign-in code from their page (App access → Give a sign-in code) – by WhatsApp, on a printed slip or on screen. With it they choose a PIN. Switch on Anonymous and Email/Password sign-in in Firebase first.", "Administrateurs: gee ’n lid sonder e-pos ’n aanmeldkode van hul bladsy af (Toegang tot die toep → Gee ’n aanmeldkode) – per WhatsApp, op ’n gedrukte strokie of op die skerm. Daarmee kies hulle ’n PIN. Skakel eers Anonieme en E-pos/Wagwoord-aanmelding in Firebase aan.", "Abaphathi: nikeza ilungu elingenayo i-imeyili ikhodi yokungena ekhasini lalo (Ukufinyelela kuhlelo → Nikeza ikhodi yokungena) – nge-WhatsApp, ephepheni eliphrintiwe noma esikrinini. Ngayo bakhetha i-PIN. Qala uvule ukungena okungaziwa (Anonymous) ne-Email/Password ku-Firebase.", "Abalawuli: nika ilungu elingenayo i-imeyile ikhowudi yokungena kwiphepha lalo (Ukufikelela kusetyenziso → Nika ikhowudi yokungena) – nge-WhatsApp, ephepheni eliprintiweyo okanye esikrinini. Ngayo bakhetha i-PIN. Qala uvule ukungena okungaziwayo (Anonymous) ne-Email/Password kwi-Firebase."],
    ['Edit details now saves as you go, like the rest of Church & Trellis – no Save button, just tap Done when you’re finished.', 'Wysig besonderhede stoor nou terwyl jy werk, soos die res van Church & Trellis – geen Stoor-knoppie nie, tik net Klaar wanneer jy klaar is.', 'Hlela imininingwane manje kugcina ngesikhathi usebenza, njengayo yonke i-Church & Trellis – ayikho inkinobho ethi Gcina, vele uthinte ethi Kwenziwe uma usuqedile.', 'Hlela iinkcukacha ngoku kugcina ngexesha usebenza, njengayo yonke iChurch & Trellis – akukho qhosha elithi Gcina, cofa nje elithi Kwenziwe xa ugqibile.'],
    ["Every drop-down list now opens in full as soon as you tap it, and narrows down as you type – handy for finding a name in a long list.", "Elke aftreklys maak nou heeltemal oop sodra jy daarop tik, en word korter terwyl jy tik – handig om ’n naam in ’n lang lys te vind.", "Lonke uhlu olwehlayo manje luvuleka lonke uma ulithinta, futhi luyancipha njengoba ubhala – kulula ukuthola igama ohlwini olude.", "Lonke uluhlu oluhlayo ngoku luvuleka lonke xa ulicofa, kwaye luyancipha njengoko ubhala – kulula ukufumana igama kuluhlu olude."],
    ["People: in Edit details, choose someone’s Spouse or partner by hand – even when they live apart – and Church & Trellis links them on both records.", "Mense: kies in Wysig besonderhede iemand se Eggenoot of lewensmaat self – selfs as hulle apart woon – en Church & Trellis koppel hulle op albei rekords.", "Abantu: ku-Hlela imininingwane, khetha Oshade naye noma umlingani womuntu ngesandla – ngisho noma behlala ngokwehlukana – futhi i-Church & Trellis ibaxhumanisa kumarekhodi omabili.", "Abantu: kuHlela iinkcukacha, khetha iQabane lomtshato okanye iqabane lomntu ngesandla – nokuba bahlala ngokwahlukeneyo – kwaye i-Church & Trellis ibadibanisa kwiirekhodi zombini."],
    ["People: Edit details now has a Maiden name box for women who are or were married, and People’s search finds them by it. Church office notes now sit near the top of a person’s page, so adding one is easy to find.", "Mense: Wysig besonderhede het nou ’n Nooiensvan-blokkie vir vroue wat getroud is of was, en Mense se soektog vind hulle daarvolgens. Kerkkantoor-notas staan nou bo-aan ’n persoon se bladsy, sodat dit maklik is om een by te voeg.", "Abantu: Ukuhlela imininingwane manje kunebhokisi lesibongo sobuntombi labesifazane abashadile noma ababeshadile, futhi ukusesha kwa-Abantu kubathola ngalo. Amanothi ehhovisi lesonto manje asphezulu ekhasini lomuntu, ukuze kube lula ukungeza elilodwa.", "Abantu: Ukuhlela iinkcukacha ngoku kunebhokisi yefani yobuntombi yabafazi abatshatileyo okanye ababetshatile, kwaye ukukhangela kwa-Abantu kubafumana ngayo. Amanqaku eofisi yecawa ngoku aphezulu kwiphepha lomntu, ukuze kube lula ukongeza elinye."],
    ["Subscription: the page now makes clear that the price is per church, not per person, and that a low price doesn’t mean Church & Trellis does less.", "Intekening: die bladsy maak nou duidelik dat die prys per kerk is, nie per persoon nie, en dat ’n lae prys nie beteken Church & Trellis doen minder nie.", "Ukubhalisa: ikhasi manje licacisa ukuthi intengo ingeyesonto, hhayi ngomuntu ngamunye, nokuthi intengo ephansi ayisho ukuthi i-Church & Trellis yenza okuncane.", "Umrhumo: iphepha ngoku licacisa ukuba ixabiso lelecawe, hayi lomntu ngamnye, nokuba ixabiso eliphantsi alithethi ukuba i-Church & Trellis yenza okuncinci."],
    ["About now has a link to Church & Trellis’s website, which shows what Church & Trellis offers to every church – handy to share with friends at other churches.", "Oor het nou ’n skakel na Church & Trellis se webwerf, wat wys wat Church & Trellis vir elke kerk bied – handig om met vriende by ander kerke te deel.", "Mayelana manje inesixhumanisi esiya kuwebhusayithi ye-Church & Trellis, ekhombisa lokho i-Church & Trellis ekunikezayo kuwo wonke amasonto – kulula ukukwabelana nabangane basemasontweni amanye.", "Malunga ngoku inekhonkco eliya kwiwebhusayithi ye-Church & Trellis, ebonisa oko i-Church & Trellis ikunikezelayo kuzo zonke iicawe – kuluncedo ukwabelana nabahlobo kwezinye iicawe."],
    ["Messages: Sent now shows only the messages you sent. Administrators and Pastors find everyone’s messages under All messages, and set up groups under Message groups.", "Boodskappe: Gestuur wys nou net die boodskappe wat jy gestuur het. Administrateurs en Pastore vind almal se boodskappe onder Alle boodskappe, en stel groepe op onder Boodskapgroepe.", "Imilayezo: Ithunyelwe manje ikhombisa kuphela imilayezo oyithumele. Abaphathi nabaFundisi bathola imilayezo yawo wonke umuntu ngaphansi kokuthi Yonke imilayezo, futhi basungula amaqembu ngaphansi kokuthi Amaqembu emilayezo.", "Imiyalezo: Ithunyelwe ngoku ibonisa kuphela imiyalezo oyithumeleyo. Abalawuli nabaFundisi bafumana imiyalezo yomntu wonke phantsi kuka-Yonke imiyalezo, kwaye baseka amaqela phantsi kuka-Amaqela emiyalezo."],
    ["Subscription: each church now gives the price of one cup where it lives, in its own money – chai from a stall, a café coffee or a coffee-chain latte, whichever is honest for the church – and the prayer card can use a photo taken there and then.", "Intekening: elke kerk gee nou die prys van een koppie waar hy is, in sy eie geld – tee by ’n stalletjie, ’n kafeekoffie of ’n latte by ’n koffieketting, wat ook al eerlik is vir die kerk – en die gebedskaart kan ’n foto gebruik wat net daar geneem word.", "Ukubhalisa: manje isonto ngalinye linikela ngentengo yenkomishi eyodwa lapho likhona, ngemali yalo – itiye lasesitolo esincane, ikhofi lasekhefi noma i-latte yesitolo esikhulu sekhofi, noma yini eqotho ngesonto – futhi ikhadi lomthandazo lingasebenzisa isithombe esithathwa khona lapho.", "Umrhumo: ngoku icawe nganye inika ixabiso lekomityi enye apho ikhoyo, ngemali yayo – iti lesitali, ikofu yekhefi okanye i-latte yevenkile enkulu yekofu, nantoni na enyanisekileyo kwicawe – kwaye ikhadi lomthandazo lingasebenzisa umfanekiso othathwe kanye apho."],
    ["Administrators: the new Subscription page (one coffee a month, or ten a year) shows when your next payment is due, lets you add a gift in one tap, and offers a free payment holiday when money is tight.", "Administrateurs: die nuwe Intekening-bladsy (een koffie per maand, of tien per jaar) wys wanneer julle volgende betaling betaalbaar is, laat julle met een tik ’n geskenk byvoeg, en bied ’n gratis betalingsvakansie wanneer geld skaars is.", "Abaphathi: ikhasi elisha lokuthi Ukubhalisa (ikhofi elilodwa ngenyanga, noma ayishumi ngonyaka) likhombisa ukuthi inkokhelo yenu elandelayo izokhokhwa nini, linivumela ukwengeza isipho ngokuthepha kanye, futhi linikeza ikhefu lokukhokha lamahhala uma imali iyindlala.", "Abalawuli: iphepha elitsha elithi Umrhumo (ikofu enye ngenyanga, okanye ezilishumi ngonyaka) libonisa ukuba intlawulo yenu elandelayo iza kuhlawulwa nini, linivumela ukongeza isipho ngokucofa kanye, kwaye linika ikhefu lokuhlawula lasimahla xa imali inqabile."],
    ["Church & Trellis is for every church: a church that can’t afford it can pray for another church each month instead, and that church appears on everyone’s Home page.", "Church & Trellis is vir elke kerk: ’n kerk wat dit nie kan bekostig nie, kan eerder elke maand vir ’n ander kerk bid, en daardie kerk verskyn op almal se Tuisblad.", "I-Church & Trellis ingeyawo wonke amasonto: isonto elingakwazi ukuyikhokhela lingathandazela elinye isonto njalo ngenyanga esikhundleni salokho, futhi lelo sonto livela ekhasini Lasekhaya lawo wonke umuntu.", "I-Church & Trellis yeyazo zonke iicawe: icawe engakwaziyo ukuyihlawulela ingathandazela enye icawe rhoqo ngenyanga endaweni yoko, kwaye loo cawe ivela kwiphepha leKhaya lomntu wonke."],
    ["Give your church a prayer card under Subscription → Our prayer card: a photo and two things to pray for, so churches in the prayer circle can pray for you.", "Gee julle kerk ’n gebedskaart onder Intekening → Ons gebedskaart: ’n foto en twee dinge om voor te bid, sodat kerke in die gebedskring vir julle kan bid.", "Nikeza isonto lenu ikhadi lomthandazo ngaphansi kokuthi Ukubhalisa → Ikhadi lethu lomthandazo: isithombe nezinto ezimbili zokuthandazela, ukuze amasonto asembuthanweni wokuthandaza anithandazele.", "Nika icawe yenu ikhadi lomthandazo phantsi kuka-Umrhumo → Ikhadi lethu lomthandazo: umfanekiso nezinto ezimbini zokuthandazela, ukuze iicawe ezikwisangqa sokuthandaza zinithandazele."],
    ["Holy Communion: under Rosters → Services, choose which Sundays of the month each service has communion, and communion servers and providers are only asked for then. For a one-off change, tap “Communion” under that date in the roster.", "Heilige Nagmaal: kies onder Roosters → Dienste op watter Sondae van die maand elke diens Nagmaal het, en Nagmaal-bedienaars en -voorsieners word net dan gevra. Vir ’n eenmalige verandering, tik op “Nagmaal” onder daardie datum in die rooster.", "Isidlo Esingcwele: ngaphansi kwe-Uhlelo lokusebenza → Izinkonzo, khetha ukuthi yimaphi amaSonto enyanga lapho inkonzo ngayinye inesiDlo Esingcwele, bese abasizi nabahlinzeki beSidlo Esingcwele becelwa ngaleso sikhathi kuphela. Ukuze ushintshe kanye nje, thepha ku-“Isidlo Esingcwele” ngaphansi kwalolo suku ohlelweni.", "Isidlo esiNgcwele: phantsi kwe-Uludwe lomsebenzi → Iinkonzo, khetha ukuba zeziphi iiCawe zenyanga apho inkonzo nganye inesiDlo esiNgcwele, kwaye abancedisi nababoneleli beSidlo esiNgcwele bacelwa ngelo xesha kuphela. Ukutshintsha kube kanye, cofa “Isidlo esiNgcwele” phantsi kwaloo mhla kuludwe."],
    ["Writing a message is easier: tap the box at the top to choose who it’s for from clear cards and lists, each showing how many people it reaches.", "Om ’n boodskap te skryf is makliker: tik op die blokkie bo-aan om te kies vir wie dit is, uit duidelike kaarte en lyste wat elk wys hoeveel mense dit bereik.", "Ukubhala umlayezo sekulula: thinta ibhokisi ephezulu ukhethe ukuthi ngowabani, emakhadini nasezinhlwini ezicacile ezikhombisa ukuthi ngamunye ufinyelela abantu abangaki.", "Ukubhala umyalezo kulula ngoku: cofa ibhokisi ephezulu ukhethe ukuba ngowabani, kumakhadi nakwizintlu ezicacileyo ezibonisa ukuba nganye ifikelela kubantu abangaphi."],
    ["Did you know?", "Het jy geweet?", "Ubuwazi?", "Ubusazi?"],
    ["Show me", "Wys my", "Ngikhombise", "Ndibonise"],
    ["Another tip", "Nog ’n wenk", "Elinye icebiso", "Elinye icebiso"],
    ["Got it", "Reg so", "Ngiyezwa", "Ndiyaqonda"],
    ["All tips", "Alle wenke", "Wonke amacebiso", "Onke amacebiso"],
    ["Tips for getting the most out of Church & Trellis", "Wenke om die meeste uit Church & Trellis te kry", "Amacebiso okusebenzisa i-Church & Trellis kahle kakhulu", "Amacebiso okusebenzisa i-Church & Trellis ngokupheleleyo"],
    // What's new
    ["Church & Trellis now moves more gently: pages and windows ease in, new messages glide into the conversation, and a small green tick shows when something is saved.", "Church & Trellis beweeg nou sagter: bladsye en vensters skuif saggies in, nuwe boodskappe gly in die gesprek in, en ’n klein groen regmerkie wys wanneer iets gestoor is.", "I-Church & Trellis manje inyakaza kahle: amakhasi namawindi angena kancane, imilayezo emisha ingena kahle engxoxweni, futhi uphawu oluncane oluluhlaza lukhombisa uma okuthile kulondoloziwe.", "I-Church & Trellis ngoku ihamba ngobunono: amaphepha neefestile zingena kancinci, imiyalezo emitsha ingena kakuhle encokolweni, kwaye uphawu oluncinci oluluhlaza lubonisa xa into igciniwe."],
    ["In Messages → Sent, you now choose how the delivery signs look from four picture cards, each showing its steps and which apps and countries use that style.", "In Boodskappe → Gestuur kies jy nou hoe die afleweringstekens lyk uit vier prentkaarte, wat elk sy stappe wys en watter apps en lande daardie styl gebruik.", "Ku-Imilayezo → Ethunyelwe, manje ukhetha ukuthi izimpawu zokulethwa zibukeka kanjani emakhadini ezithombe amane, ngalinye likhombisa izinyathelo zalo nokuthi yiziphi izinhlelo zokusebenza namazwe asebenzisa leso sitayela.", "Kwi-Imiyalezo → Ethunyelweyo, ngoku ukhetha ukuba iimpawu zokufikiswa zijongeka njani kumakhadi emifanekiso amane, ngalinye libonisa amanyathelo alo kunye nokuba zeziphi ii-app namazwe asebenzisa olo hlobo."],
    ["Updates are smaller now: a new version of Church & Trellis downloads only the parts that changed, so it uses much less data.", "Opdaterings is nou kleiner: ’n nuwe weergawe van Church & Trellis laai net die dele af wat verander het, so dit gebruik baie minder data.", "Izibuyekezo sezincane manje: inguqulo entsha ye-Church & Trellis ilanda kuphela izingxenye ezishintshile, ngakho isebenzisa idatha encane kakhulu.", "Uhlaziyo luncinci ngoku: inguqulelo entsha ye-Church & Trellis ikhuphela kuphela iinxalenye ezitshintshileyo, ngoko isebenzisa idatha encinci kakhulu."],
    ["Librarians: the Find book covers window now keeps your place while it searches, instead of jumping back to the top after every book.", "Bibliotekarisse: die Soek boekomslae-venster hou nou jou plek terwyl dit soek, in plaas daarvan om ná elke boek terug te spring na bo.", "Abaphathi bomtapo wolwazi: iwindi elithi Sesha amakhava ezincwadi manje ligcina lapho ubukhona ngesikhathi lisesha, esikhundleni sokubuyela phezulu emva kwencwadi ngayinye.", "Abagcini bethala leencwadi: ifestile ethi Khangela amaqweqwe eencwadi ngoku igcina apho ubukhona xa ikhangela, endaweni yokubuyela phezulu emva kwencwadi nganye."],
    ["Your Me page has a new Consent tab: it shows what you’ve agreed to, and what each “No” means for you.", "Jou Ek-bladsy het ’n nuwe Toestemming-oortjie: dit wys waartoe jy ingestem het, en wat elke “Nee” vir jou beteken.", "Ikhasi lakho elithi Mina linethebhu entsha ethi Imvume: likhombisa lokho okuvumile, nokuthi “Cha” ngayinye isho ukuthini kuwe.", "Iphepha lakho elithi Mna linethebhu entsha ethi Imvume: libonisa oko uvumileyo kuko, kunye nokuba “Hayi” nganye ithetha ntoni kuwe."],
    ["You can now reply to a message: tap Reply and your answer goes privately to the person who sent it.", "Jy kan nou op ’n boodskap antwoord: tik Antwoord en jou antwoord gaan privaat na die persoon wat dit gestuur het.", "Manje ungaphendula umlayezo: thepha okuthi Phendula futhi impendulo yakho iya ngasese kumuntu owuthumele.", "Ngoku unokuphendula umyalezo: cofa u-Phendula kwaye impendulo yakho iya ngasese kumntu owuthumeleyo."],
    ["The Library now shows each item once, with who has it on its own row, and has tabs for overdue, damaged and withdrawn items.", "Die biblioteek wys nou elke item een keer, met wie dit het op sy eie ry, en het oortjies vir laat, beskadigde en uit omloop items.", "Umtapo wezincwadi manje ukhombisa into ngayinye kanye, nokuthi ubani onayo emugqeni wayo, futhi unamathebhu ezinto eziphuze ukubuyiswa, ezonakele nezikhishwe ekusetshenzisweni.", "Ithala leencwadi ngoku libonisa into nganye kanye, nokuba ngubani onayo kumgca wayo, kwaye linamathebhu ezinto ezigqithe ixesha, ezonakeleyo nezikhutshwe ekusetyenzisweni."],
    ["Settings → Attendees decides what people who aren’t Church Partners yet may see and do in Church & Trellis.", "Instellings → Bywoners besluit wat mense wat nog nie Kerkvennote is nie in Church & Trellis mag sien en doen.", "Izilungiselelo → Abahambela isonto zinquma ukuthi abantu abangakabi ngabalingani beBandla bangabonani futhi benzeni ku-Church & Trellis.", "Iisetingi → Abahamba icawe zigqiba ukuba abantu abangekabi ngamaqabane eCawa bangabona ntoni kwaye benze ntoni kwi-Church & Trellis."],
    ["Home now shows what’s new in Church & Trellis, and a tip each time you sign in.", "Tuis wys nou wat nuut is in Church & Trellis, en ’n wenk elke keer as jy aanmeld.", "Ikhaya manje likhombisa okusha ku-Church & Trellis, necebiso njalo uma ungena.", "Ekhaya ngoku kubonisa okutsha kwi-Church & Trellis, necebiso qho xa ungena."],
    ["Librarians: covers found online now work for many more books, you can ask for another cover if the first is wrong, and each item’s ⋯ menu and Edit form have “Find a cover online”.", "Bibliotekarisse: omslae wat aanlyn gevind word, werk nou vir baie meer boeke, jy kan vir ’n ander omslag vra as die eerste verkeerd is, en elke item se ⋯-kieslys en Wysig-vorm het “Soek ’n omslag aanlyn”.", "Abaphathi bomtapo wolwazi: amakhava atholakala ku-inthanethi manje asebenza ezincwadini eziningi kakhulu, ungacela elinye ikhava uma elokuqala lingalungile, futhi imenyu ethi ⋯ nefomu lokuHlela lento ngayinye kunokuthi “Sesha ikhava ku-inthanethi”.", "Abagcini bethala leencwadi: amaqweqwe afunyanwa kwi-intanethi ngoku asebenza kwiincwadi ezininzi ngakumbi, ungacela elinye iqweqwe ukuba elokuqala alichanekanga, kwaye imenyu ethi ⋯ nefomu yokuHlela yento nganye inokuthi “Khangela iqweqwe kwi-intanethi”."],
    ["Dates can now be typed, like 12 Aug 1990 – birthdays, anniversaries and every other date – so there’s no more tapping back through the calendar month by month.", "Datums kan nou getik word, soos 12 Aug 1990 – verjaarsdae, herdenkings en elke ander datum – so jy hoef nie meer maand vir maand deur die kalender terug te tik nie.", "Izinsuku manje zingabhalwa, njengo-12 Aga 1990 – izinsuku zokuzalwa, izikhumbuzo nanoma yiluphi olunye usuku – ngakho akusadingeki ukuchofoza emuva ekhalendeni inyanga ngenyanga.", "Imihla ngoku ingachwethezwa, njenge-12 Aga 1990 – imihla yokuzalwa, izikhumbuzo nawuphi na omnye umhla – ngoko akusafuneki ukucofa umva kwikhalenda inyanga nenyanga."],
    ["About now has a round ✕ at the top right that stays there as you scroll, so you can always get back – handy on the Android app.", "Oor het nou ’n ronde ✕ regs bo wat bly staan terwyl jy rol, sodat jy altyd kan teruggaan – handig op die Android-toep.", "Mayelana manje ine-✕ eyindilinga phezulu ngakwesokudla ehlala ikhona uma uskrola, ukuze uhlale ukwazi ukubuyela emuva – iwusizo ku-app ye-Android.", "Malunga ngoku ine-✕ esisangqa phezulu ngasekunene ehlala ikhona xa usiskrola, ukuze uhlale ukwazi ukubuyela umva – iluncedo kwi-app ye-Android."],
    ["Chinese and Japanese can now be chosen as languages; for now only the main screens are translated.", "Chinees en Japannees kan nou as tale gekies word; vir eers is net die hoofskerms vertaal.", "IsiShayina nesiJaphani manje kungakhethwa njengezilimi; okwamanje yizikrini ezinkulu kuphela ezihunyushiwe.", "IsiTshayina nesiJapan ngoku zinokukhethwa njengeelwimi; okwangoku zizikrini eziphambili kuphela eziguqulelweyo."],
    ["Sesotho can now be chosen as written in South Africa or in Lesotho.", "Sesotho kan nou gekies word soos dit in Suid-Afrika of in Lesotho geskryf word.", "I-Sesotho manje ingakhethwa njengoba ibhalwa eNingizimu Afrika noma eLesotho.", "IsiSuthu ngoku singakhethwa njengoko sibhalwa eMzantsi Afrika okanye eLesotho."],
    ["Church & Trellis fits phones better: buttons no longer squeeze names and wording (Translations, Leave approvals, Serving together), Terminology and school terms fit the screen, and menus open within it.", "Church & Trellis pas beter op fone: knoppies druk nie meer name en bewoording saam nie (Vertalings, Verlofgoedkeurings, Saam dien), Terminologie en skoolkwartale pas op die skerm, en kieslyste maak binne die skerm oop.", "IChurch & Trellis ilingana kangcono namaselula: izinkinobho azisawacindezeli amagama nemibhalo (Ukuhumusha, Ukugunyazwa kwekhefu, Ukusebenza ndawonye), Amagama esonto namatemu esikole kulingana nesikrini, futhi amamenyu avuleka ngaphakathi kwaso.", "IChurch & Trellis ilingana ngcono neefowuni: amaqhosha akasawacinezeli amagama nemibhalo (Iinguqulelo, Ukuvunywa kwekhefu, Ukukhonza kunye), Amagama ecawa namakota esikolo ayalingana nesikrini, kwaye iimenyu zivuleka ngaphakathi kwaso."],
    ["When you edit someone on a phone, each Care Group now has its own line, and the “leads it” tick appears only once that group is ticked.", "Wanneer jy iemand op ’n foon wysig, het elke selgroep nou sy eie reël, en die “lei dit”-merkie verskyn eers wanneer daardie groep gemerk is.", "Uma uhlela umuntu ocingweni, iqembu ngalinye lokunakekelana manje linomugqa walo, futhi ithikhi elithi “uyaliphatha” livela kuphela uma lelo qembu selithikhiwe.", "Xa uhlela umntu efowunini, iqela ngalinye lokukhathalelana ngoku linomgca walo, kwaye ithikhi elithi “uyalikhokela” livela kuphela xa elo qela lithikhiwe."],
    ["Tap the ticks by your message’s time to see what they mean – a short note pops up and disappears by itself.", "Tik op die regmerkies by jou boodskap se tyd om te sien wat hulle beteken – ’n kort nota verskyn en verdwyn vanself.", "Thepha amathikhi eduze kwesikhathi somlayezo wakho ukuze ubone ukuthi asho ukuthini – kuvela inothi elifushane bese linyamalala lodwa.", "Cofa amathikhi akufutshane nexesha lomyalezo wakho ukuze ubone ukuba athetha ntoni – kuvela inqaku elifutshane emva koko linyamalale ngokwalo."],
    ["Messages can now show what the ticks mean, and you can choose ticks, envelopes, a filling circle or words; the first tick turns blue once some have read a group message.", "Boodskappe kan nou wys wat die regmerkies beteken, en jy kan regmerkies, koeverte, ’n sirkel wat vol word of woorde kies; die eerste regmerkie word blou sodra sommige ’n groepboodskap gelees het.", "Imilayezo manje ingakhombisa okushiwo amathikhi, futhi ungakhetha amathikhi, izimvilophu, indilinga egcwalayo noma amagama; ithikhi lokuqala liba luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka uma abanye sebewufundile umlayezo weqembu.", "Imiyalezo ngoku ingabonisa oko kuthethwa ngamathikhi, kwaye ungakhetha amathikhi, iimvulophu, isangqa esizalisekayo okanye amagama; ithikhi lokuqala liba luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka xa abanye sele bewufundile umyalezo weqela."],
    ["Messages now look like a chat: two blue ticks show that everyone has read yours.", "Boodskappe lyk nou soos ’n klets: twee blou regmerkies wys dat almal joune gelees het.", "Imilayezo manje ibukeka njengengxoxo: amathikhi amabili aluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka akhombisa ukuthi bonke bawufundile owakho.", "Imiyalezo ngoku ijongeka ngathi yincoko: amathikhi amabini aluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka abonisa ukuba bonke bawufundile owakho."],
    ["The Library is tidier: one Add button, everything else under More, and repairs in each item’s ⋯ menu.", "Die biblioteek is netjieser: een Voeg by-knoppie, alles anders onder Meer, en herstelwerk in elke item se ⋯-kieslys.", "Umtapo wezincwadi uhleleke kangcono: inkinobho eyodwa yokwengeza, konke okunye ngaphansi kokuthi Okunye, nokulungisa kumenyu ethi ⋯ yento ngayinye.", "Ithala leencwadi licoceke ngakumbi: iqhosha elinye lokongeza, yonke enye into phantsi kokuthi Okunye, nokulungisa kwimenyu ethi ⋯ yento nganye."],
    ["Settings → Terminology now suggests ministry roles and titles for the church’s administrator.", "Instellings → Terminologie stel nou bedieningsrolle en titels vir die kerk se administrateur voor.", "Izilungiselelo → Amagama manje ziphakamisa izindima zenkonzo neziqu zomphathi wesonto.", "Iisetingi → Isigama ngoku sicebisa iindima zobulungiseleli nezihloko zomlawuli wecawe."],
    // Everyone
    ["Your Me page has your own details, and you can update your contact details there yourself.", "Jou Ek-bladsy het jou eie besonderhede, en jy kan self jou kontakbesonderhede daar bywerk.", "Ikhasi lakho elithi Mina linemininingwane yakho, futhi ungazibuyekeza ngokwakho lapho imininingwane yokuxhumana nawe.", "Iphepha lakho elithi Mna lineenkcukacha zakho, kwaye unokuzihlaziya ngokwakho apho iinkcukacha zoqhagamshelwano."],
    ["Going away? Add your days away on your Me page, so nobody puts you on a roster while you’re gone.", "Gaan jy weg? Voeg jou dae weg op jou Ek-bladsy by, sodat niemand jou op ’n rooster plaas terwyl jy weg is nie.", "Uyahamba? Engeza izinsuku ongekho kulo ekhasini lakho elithi Mina, ukuze kungabikho muntu okufaka ohlelweni ungekho.", "Uyahamba? Yongeza iintsuku ongekho ngazo kwiphepha lakho elithi Mna, ukuze kungabikho mntu ukufaka kuludwe ungekho."],
    ["When you’re put on a roster, you can accept or decline the turn under Me → Serving.", "Wanneer jy op ’n rooster geplaas word, kan jy die beurt onder Ek → Dien aanvaar of van die hand wys.", "Uma ufakwe ohlelweni, ungalamukela noma ulenqabe ithuba ngaphansi kokuthi Mina → Ukukhonza.", "Xa ufakwe kuludwe, unokulamkela okanye ulale ithuba phantsi kokuthi Mna → Ukukhonza."],
    ["Would you like to help? Under Me → Serving you can offer to serve in a team.", "Wil jy graag help? Onder Ek → Dien kan jy aanbied om in ’n span te dien.", "Ungathanda ukusiza? Ngaphansi kokuthi Mina → Ukukhonza ungazinikela ukukhonza ethimbeni.", "Ungathanda ukunceda? Phantsi kokuthi Mna → Ukukhonza unokuzinikela ukukhonza kwiqela."],
    ["Church & Trellis speaks your language. Choose English, Afrikaans, isiZulu, isiXhosa, Sesotho or another language on your Me page.", "Church & Trellis praat jou taal. Kies Engels, Afrikaans, isiZulu, isiXhosa, Sesotho of ’n ander taal op jou Ek-bladsy.", "I-Church & Trellis ikhuluma ulimi lwakho. Khetha isiNgisi, isiBhunu, isiZulu, isiXhosa, isiSuthu noma olunye ulimi ekhasini lakho elithi Mina.", "I-Church & Trellis ithetha ulwimi lwakho. Khetha isiNgesi, isiBhulu, isiZulu, isiXhosa, isiSuthu okanye olunye ulwimi kwiphepha lakho elithi Mna."],
    ["The church has a library. Open Library to see what is there – what you have borrowed shows on your Me page.", "Die kerk het ’n biblioteek. Maak Biblioteek oop om te sien wat daar is – wat jy geleen het, wys op jou Ek-bladsy.", "Isonto linomtapo wezincwadi. Vula Umtapo wezincwadi ubone okukhona – okubolekile kukhombisa ekhasini lakho elithi Mina.", "Icawe inethala leencwadi. Vula iThala leencwadi ubone okukhoyo – oko ukuboleke kubonakala kwiphepha lakho elithi Mna."],
    ["Seen a book you’d like to read? Tap Request to borrow in the Library, and a librarian will get it ready for you.", "Het jy ’n boek gesien wat jy graag wil lees? Tik Versoek om te leen in die biblioteek, en ’n bibliotekaris sal dit vir jou gereed kry.", "Ubone incwadi ongathanda ukuyifunda? Thepha okuthi Cela ukuboleka eMtapweni wezincwadi, futhi umgcini womtapo uzokulungiselela yona.", "Ubone incwadi ongathanda ukuyifunda? Cofa u-Cela ukuboleka kwiThala leencwadi, kwaye umgcini-thala uya kukulungiselela yona."],
    ["Messages from the church arrive under Messages. You can write to the church office there too.", "Boodskappe van die kerk kom onder Boodskappe aan. Jy kan ook daar aan die kerkkantoor skryf.", "Imilayezo evela esontweni ifika ngaphansi kokuthi Imilayezo. Ungabhalela nehhovisi lesonto lapho.", "Imiyalezo evela ecaweni ifika phantsi kokuthi Imiyalezo. Unokubhalela neofisi yecawe apho."],
    ["Groups → My groups shows the groups you belong to.", "Groepe → My groepe wys die groepe waaraan jy behoort.", "Amaqembu → Amaqembu ami akhombisa amaqembu oyilungu lawo.", "Amaqela → Amaqela am abonisa amaqela oyilungu lawo."],
    ["No internet? Church & Trellis still shows what you last saw, view only, until you’re back online.", "Geen internet nie? Church & Trellis wys steeds wat jy laas gesien het, net om te kyk, totdat jy weer aanlyn is.", "Ayikho i-inthanethi? I-Church & Trellis isakhombisa lokho owakubona okokugcina, ukubuka kuphela, uze ubuyele ku-inthanethi.", "Akukho intanethi? I-Church & Trellis isabonisa oko ukubone okokugqibela, ukujonga kuphela, de ubuyele kwi-intanethi."],
    // Librarians
    ["As a librarian, you lend an item with its Lend button, and tap Returned when it comes back.", "As bibliotekaris leen jy ’n item uit met sy Leen uit-knoppie, en tik Terugbesorg wanneer dit terugkom.", "Njengomgcini womtapo, uboleka umuntu into ngenkinobho yayo ethi Boleka umuntu, bese uthepha okuthi Ibuyisiwe uma ibuya.", "Njengomgcini-thala, uboleka umntu into ngeqhosha layo elithi Boleka umntu, uze ucofe u-Ibuyisiwe xa ibuya."],
    ["Something damaged? In the item’s ⋯ menu, choose Mark as damaged – nobody can borrow it until it is repaired or put back.", "Iets beskadig? Kies Merk as beskadig in die item se ⋯-kieslys – niemand kan dit leen voordat dit herstel of teruggesit is nie.", "Kukhona okonakele? Kumenyu ethi ⋯ yento, khetha okuthi Phawula ukuthi konakele – akekho ongayiboleka ize ilungiswe noma ibuyiselwe.", "Kukho into eyonakeleyo? Kwimenyu ethi ⋯ yento, khetha u-Phawula ukuba yonakele – akukho mntu unokuyiboleka ide ilungiswe okanye ibuyiselwe."],
    ["Lost, or no longer needed? In the item’s ⋯ menu choose Withdraw from circulation or Take out of the library – it can be put back later.", "Verloor, of nie meer nodig nie? Kies Haal uit omloop of Haal uit die biblioteek in die item se ⋯-kieslys – dit kan later teruggesit word.", "Ilahlekile, noma ayisadingeki? Kumenyu ethi ⋯ yento khetha okuthi Khipha ekusetshenzisweni noma Khipha emtapweni – ingabuyiselwa kamuva.", "Ilahlekile, okanye ayisafuneki? Kwimenyu ethi ⋯ yento khetha u-Khupha ekusetyenzisweni okanye Khupha kwithala – ingabuyiselwa kamva."],
    ["Three weeks after a loan Church & Trellis reminds the borrower. You can also send the reminder by WhatsApp or SMS.", "Drie weke ná ’n uitlening herinner Church & Trellis die lener. Jy kan die herinnering ook per WhatsApp of SMS stuur.", "Emasontweni amathathu ngemuva kokuboleka, i-Church & Trellis ikhumbuza obolekile. Ungathumela nesikhumbuzo nge-WhatsApp noma nge-SMS.", "Kwiiveki ezintathu emva kokuboleka, i-Church & Trellis ikhumbuza oboleke. Unokuthumela nesikhumbuzo nge-WhatsApp okanye nge-SMS."],
    ["Members can ask to borrow an item. Their requests wait at the top of the Library for you to say yes or no.", "Lidmate kan vra om ’n item te leen. Hul versoeke wag bo-aan die biblioteek sodat jy ja of nee kan sê.", "Amalungu angacela ukuboleka into. Izicelo zawo zilinda phezulu eMtapweni wezincwadi ukuze uthi yebo noma cha.", "Amalungu angacela ukuboleka into. Izicelo zawo zilinda phezulu kwiThala leencwadi ukuze uthi ewe okanye hayi."],
    ["Library → More → Reports shows what was lent, returned, lost and added in any period.", "Biblioteek → Meer → Verslae wys wat in enige tydperk uitgeleen, terugbesorg, verloor en bygevoeg is.", "Umtapo wezincwadi → Okunye → Imibiko ikhombisa okubolekiwe, okubuyisiwe, okulahlekile nokwengeziwe kunoma isiphi isikhathi.", "Ithala leencwadi → Okunye → Iingxelo zibonisa okubolekiweyo, okubuyisiweyo, okulahlekileyo nokongeziweyo nangaliphi na ixesha."],
    // Carers
    ["As a carer, you can send a message to everyone in your Care Group from Messages.", "As leier kan jy uit Boodskappe ’n boodskap aan almal in jou selgroep stuur.", "Njengomnakekeli, ungathumela umlayezo kubo bonke abaseqenjini lakho lokunakekelana ku-Imilayezo.", "Njengomkhathaleli, unokuthumela umyalezo kubo bonke abakwiqela lakho lokukhathalelana kwi-Imiyalezo."],
    // Roster coordinators
    ["Fill the gaps for me (on Rosters) suggests fair turns, keeping everyone’s days away and leave in mind.", "Vul die gapings vir my (op Roosters) stel regverdige beurte voor, met almal se dae weg en verlof in gedagte.", "Ngigcwalisela izikhala (ku-Uhlelo lokusebenza) iphakamisa amathuba alinganayo, icabangela izinsuku zabo bonke abangekho nekhefu.", "Ndizalisele izithuba (kwi-Uludwe lomsebenzi) icebisa amathuba alinganayo, ithathela ingqalelo iintsuku zabo bonke abangekho nekhefu."],
    ["Offers to serve from members wait for you at the top of Rosters → Teams.", "Aanbiedinge van lidmate om te dien wag vir jou bo-aan Roosters → Spanne.", "Iminikelo yamalungu yokukhonza ikulindile phezulu ku-Uhlelo lokusebenza → Amathimba.", "Iminikelo yamalungu yokukhonza ikulindile phezulu kwi-Uludwe lomsebenzi → Amaqela omsebenzi."],
    // Children's ministry
    ["Children’s medical notes are seen only by Children’s ministry – not even Administrators see them.", "Kinders se mediese notas word net deur Kinderbediening gesien – selfs Administrateurs sien hulle nie.", "Amanothi ezempilo ezingane abonwa yi-Inkonzo yezingane kuphela – ngisho nabaPhathi abawaboni.", "Amanqaku ezempilo abantwana abonwa bubuLungiseleli babantwana kuphela – nkqu naBalawuli abawaboni."],
    // Pastors
    ["Pastoral notes on a person’s page are seen only by Pastors.", "Pastorale notas op ’n persoon se bladsy word net deur Pastore gesien.", "Amanothi obufundisi ekhasini lomuntu abonwa ngabaFundisi kuphela.", "Amanqaku obufundisi kwiphepha lomntu abonwa ngabaFundisi kuphela."],
    ["As Senior Pastor you can use View as… to see Church & Trellis the way another role sees it.", "As Senior Pastoor kan jy Sien as… gebruik om Church & Trellis te sien soos ’n ander rol dit sien.", "NjengoMfundisi Omkhulu ungasebenzisa okuthi Bona njenge… ukuze ubone i-Church & Trellis ngendlela enye indima eyibona ngayo.", "NjengoMfundisi Omkhulu unokusebenzisa u-Bona njenge… ukuze ubone i-Church & Trellis ngendlela enye indima eyibona ngayo."],
    // Staff
    ["Advanced search on People finds people by almost anything – their age, a birthday coming up, the service they serve at.", "Gevorderde soektog op Mense vind mense volgens byna enigiets – hul ouderdom, ’n verjaardag wat nader kom, die diens waar hulle dien.", "Ukusesha okuthuthukile ku-Abantu kuthola abantu cishe ngayo yonke into – iminyaka yabo, usuku lokuzalwa oluzayo, inkonzo abakhonza kuyo.", "Ukukhangela okuphambili kwi-Abantu kufumana abantu phantse ngayo nantoni na – iminyaka yabo, umhla wokuzalwa ozayo, inkonzo abakhonza kuyo."],
    // Administrators
    ["Use View as… in the menu to see exactly what a Pastor, a Roster coordinator or a member sees.", "Gebruik Sien as… in die kieslys om presies te sien wat ’n Pastoor, ’n Roosterkoördineerder of ’n lidmaat sien.", "Sebenzisa okuthi Bona njenge… kumenyu ukuze ubone kahle lokho okubonwa nguMfundisi, uMhleli wohlelo lokusebenza noma ilungu.", "Sebenzisa u-Bona njenge… kwimenyu ukuze ubone kanye oko kubonwa nguMfundisi, uMququzeleli woludwe lomsebenzi okanye ilungu."],
    ["Settings → Apps switches parts of Church & Trellis on and off, such as the Library or Midweek Groups.", "Instellings → Dele skakel dele van Church & Trellis aan en af, soos die biblioteek of Lewensgroepe.", "Izilungiselelo → Izingxenye kuvula futhi kuvale izingxenye ze-Church & Trellis, njengoMtapo wezincwadi noma Amaqembu empilo.", "Iisetingi → Amacandelo kuvula kwaye kuvale amacandelo e-Church & Trellis, njengeThala leencwadi okanye Amaqela obomi."],
    ["In Advanced search you can tick people in the results and change one thing for all of them at once.", "In Gevorderde soektog kan jy mense in die resultate merk en een ding vir hulle almal gelyk verander.", "Ku-Ukusesha okuthuthukile ungamaka abantu emiphumeleni bese ushintsha into eyodwa kubo bonke ngesikhathi esisodwa.", "Kwi-Ukukhangela okuphambili unokuphawula abantu kwiziphumo uze utshintshe into enye kubo bonke ngaxeshanye."],
    ["Find duplicates (on People) helps you join two records of the same person into one.", "Soek duplikate (op Mense) help jou om twee rekords van dieselfde persoon in een saam te voeg.", "Thola abaphindiwe (ku-Abantu) kukusiza ukuhlanganisa amarekhodi amabili omuntu oyedwa abe yinye.", "Fumana abaphindiweyo (kwi-Abantu) kukunceda ukudibanisa iirekhodi ezimbini zomntu omnye zibe nye."],
    ["Settings → Who can see what decides which contact details each role may see.", "Instellings → Wie wat kan sien bepaal watter kontakbesonderhede elke rol mag sien.", "Izilungiselelo → Ubani ongabona ini kunquma ukuthi iyiphi imininingwane yokuxhumana indima ngayinye engayibona.", "Iisetingi → Ngubani onokubona ntoni kugqiba ukuba zeziphi iinkcukacha zoqhagamshelwano indima nganye enokuzibona."],
    ["When you’re put on a roster, a message now comes to your Messages inbox, and you can accept or say you can’t make it right there.", "As jy op ’n rooster geplaas word, kom daar nou ’n boodskap in jou Boodskappe-inkassie, en jy kan net daar aanvaar of sê dat jy nie kan kom nie.", "Uma ufakwa ohlelweni lokusebenza, manje umlayezo ufika ku-Imilayezo yakho, futhi ungamukela noma usho ukuthi ngeke ukwazi ukuza khona lapho.", "Xa ufakwa kuludwe lomsebenzi, ngoku umyalezo ufika kwi-Imiyalezo yakho, kwaye ungamkela okanye uthi akunakukwazi ukuza kanye apho."],
    ["Roster coordinators: when someone says they can’t make it, you now get a message. Rosters → More → Remind those who haven’t replied sends everyone still to answer a reminder.", "Roosterkoördineerders: as iemand sê hulle kan nie kom nie, kry jy nou ’n boodskap. Roosters → Meer → Herinner dié wat nog nie geantwoord het nie stuur almal wat nog moet antwoord ’n herinnering.", "Abahleli bohlelo lokusebenza: uma umuntu ethi ngeke akwazi ukuza, manje uthola umlayezo. Uhlelo lokusebenza → Okunye → Khumbuza labo abangakaphenduli kuthumela isikhumbuzo kubo bonke abangakaphenduli.", "Abaququzeleli boludwe lomsebenzi: xa umntu esithi akanakukwazi ukuza, ngoku ufumana umyalezo. Uludwe lomsebenzi → Okunye → Khumbuza abo bangekaphenduli kuthumela isikhumbuzo kubo bonke abangekaphenduli."],
    ["Administrators and Roster coordinators hear when someone can’t make a roster turn. To include someone else, such as the church secretary, add them under Settings → Church Services.", "Administrateurs en Roosterkoördineerders hoor wanneer iemand nie ’n roosterbeurt kan doen nie. Om iemand anders in te sluit, soos die kerksekretaresse, voeg hulle by onder Instellings → Kerkdienste.", "Abaphathi nabahleli bohlelo lokusebenza bayezwa uma umuntu ngeke akwazi ukwenza ithuba lakhe ohlwini. Ukufaka omunye umuntu, njengonobhala wesonto, mengeze ngaphansi kweZilungiselelo → Izinkonzo Zesonto.", "Abalawuli nabaququzeleli boludwe lomsebenzi bayeva xa umntu engenakukwazi ukwenza ithuba lakhe kuluhlu. Ukuquka omnye umntu, njengonobhala wecawe, mongeze phantsi kweeSetingi → Iinkonzo zeCawe."],
    ["New: the Community board and the Marketplace. Switch them on under Settings → Apps. The pastors, the Administrators and the church secretary check everything before anyone sees it – change who under More → Keepers….", "Nuut: die Gemeenskapsbord en die Markplein. Skakel hulle aan onder Instellings → Dele. Die pastore, die Administrateurs en die kerksekretaris kyk na alles voordat iemand dit sien – verander wie onder Meer → Toesighouers….", "Okusha: iBhodi lomphakathi neMakethe. Kuvule ngaphansi kokuthi Izilungiselelo → Izingxenye. Abefundisi, abaPhathi nonobhala webandla bahlola konke ngaphambi kokuba kubone noma ubani – shintsha ukuthi ngubani ngaphansi kokuthi Okunye → Abaqaphi….", "Okutsha: iBhodi yoluntu neMarike. Zivule phantsi kwe-Iisetingi → Amacandelo. Abafundisi, abaLawuli nonobhala wecawa bahlola yonke into phambi kokuba nabani na ayibone – tshintsha ukuba ngubani phantsi kwe-Okunye → Abajongi…."],
    ["The Community board is here: pin a sticky note to ask for help, offer it or say thank you. The latest three show on your Home page.", "Die Gemeenskapsbord is hier: steek ’n plaknota vas om vir hulp te vra, dit aan te bied of dankie te sê. Die nuutste drie wys op jou Tuisblad.", "IBhodi lomphakathi selifikile: namathisela inothi ukuze ucele usizo, ulunikeze noma usho ukuthi ngiyabonga. Ezintathu zakamuva zivela ekhasini lakho Lasekhaya.", "IBhodi yoluntu ifikile: ncamathisela inqaku ukuze ucele uncedo, ulubonelele okanye uthi enkosi. Amathathu amatsha avela kwiKhaya lakho."],
    ["The Marketplace is here: buy, sell and give away within the church. A keeper checks every listing before anyone sees it.", "Die Markplein is hier: koop, verkoop en gee weg binne die kerk. ’n Toesighouer kyk na elke advertensie voordat iemand dit sien.", "IMakethe isifikile: thenga, thengisa futhi unikele ngaphakathi ebandleni. Umqaphi uhlola isikhangiso ngasinye ngaphambi kokuba kubone noma ubani.", "IMarike ifikile: thenga, thengisa kwaye unikele ngaphakathi ecaweni. Umjongi uhlola intengiso nganye phambi kokuba nabani na ayibone."],
    ["Tap a note on the Community board to see all of it and write privately to the person who pinned it.", "Tik op ’n nota op die Gemeenskapsbord om alles te sien en privaat te skryf aan die persoon wat dit vasgesteek het.", "Thepha inothi eBhodini lomphakathi ukuze ulibone lonke futhi ubhalele ngasese umuntu olinamathiselile.", "Cofa inqaku kwiBhodi yoluntu ukuze ulibone lonke kwaye ubhalele ngasese umntu olincamathiseleyo."],
    ["Listing something on the Marketplace? Add up to three photos – Church & Trellis makes them small, so they cost little data.", "Adverteer jy iets op die Markplein? Voeg tot drie foto’s by – Church & Trellis maak hulle klein, sodat hulle min data kos.", "Ukhangisa okuthile eMakethe? Engeza izithombe ezifika kwezintathu – i-Church & Trellis iyazinciphisa, ukuze zidle idatha encane.", "Ubhengeza into kwiMarike? Yongeza ukuya kwiifoto ezintathu – i-Church & Trellis iyazinciphisa, ukuze zitye idatha encinci."],
    ["Midweek Group leaders: post this week’s meeting link and notes under Groups → Midweek Groups. Your group gets them in Messages, with Join the meeting and Open the notes – now or on the day.", "Middeweekse groepleiers: plaas hierdie week se vergaderskakel en notas onder Groepe → Middeweekse groepe. Jou groep kry dit in Boodskappe, met Sluit by die vergadering aan en Maak die notas oop – nou of op die dag.", "Abaholi bamaqembu aphakathi nesonto: fakani isixhumanisi somhlangano namanothi aleli sonto ngaphansi kwe-Amaqembu → Amaqembu aphakathi nesonto. Iqembu lakho liwathola kuMilayezo, kanye no-Joyina umhlangano no-Vula amanothi – manje noma ngalolo suku.", "Iinkokeli zamaqela aphakathi evekini: fakani ikhonkco lentlanganiso namanqaku aleveki phantsi kwe-Amaqela → Amaqela aphakathi evekini. Iqela lakho liwafumana kwiMiyalezo, kunye no-Joyina intlanganiso no-Vula amanqaku – ngoku okanye ngaloo mini."],
    ["On the day of your Midweek Group, Home shows a card with Join the meeting and Open the notes – it becomes Join now 15 minutes before.", "Op die dag van jou middeweekse groep wys Tuis ’n kaart met Sluit by die vergadering aan en Maak die notas oop – 15 minute vooraf word dit Sluit nou aan.", "Ngosuku lweqembu lakho laphakathi nesonto, Ikhaya libonisa ikhadi elinokuthi Joyina umhlangano no-Vula amanothi – liba ngu-Joyina manje emizuzwini eyi-15 ngaphambili.", "Ngomhla weqela lakho laphakathi evekini, iKhaya libonisa ikhadi elinokuthi Joyina intlanganiso no-Vula amanqaku – liba ngu-Joyina ngoku kwimizuzu eli-15 ngaphambili."],
    ["Missed a Midweek Group? Its page keeps Past studies, with the notes for each week.", "’n Middeweekse groep gemis? Sy blad hou Vorige studies, met die notas vir elke week.", "Uphuthelwe iqembu laphakathi nesonto? Ikhasi lalo ligcina Izifundo ezedlule, namanothi esonto ngalinye.", "Uphoswe liqela laphakathi evekini? Iphepha lalo ligcina Izifundo ezidlulileyo, namanqaku eveki nganye."],
    ["Settings: who can see what, Attendees and What Pastors can do are now one page, Access and roles – a card for each kind of person says what they see and can do, with View as one tap away. Nothing about anyone’s access has changed.", "Instellings: wie wat kan sien, Bywoners en Wat predikante kan doen is nou een blad, Toegang en rolle – ’n kaart vir elke soort persoon sê wat hulle sien en kan doen, met Bekyk as een tik weg. Niks aan iemand se toegang het verander nie.", "Izilungiselelo: ubani angabona ini, Izivakashi nokuthi Abefundisi bangenzani manje kuyikhasi elilodwa, Ukufinyelela nezindima – ikhadi lohlobo ngalunye lomuntu lisho abakubonayo nabangakwenza, kanye no-Buka njenga ngokuthinta kanye. Akukho okushintshile ekufinyeleleni kwanoma ubani.", "IiSetingi: ngubani onokubona ntoni, Abazimasi nokuba Abafundisi banokwenza ntoni ngoku liphepha elinye, Ufikelelo neendima – ikhadi lohlobo ngalunye lomntu lithi bakubona ntoni nokuba banokwenza ntoni, kunye no-Jonga njenga ngokuchukumisa kanye. Akukho nto itshintshileyo kufikelelo lomntu."],
    ["Invite people to Church & Trellis by email or WhatsApp – one person from their page, or a whole Care Group, Midweek Group or serving team from Advanced search. It gives them access, and People → Invitations shows who hasn’t started yet, with Remind.", "Nooi mense na Church & Trellis per e-pos of WhatsApp – een persoon vanaf hul bladsy, of ’n hele Sorggroep, Middeweekse Groep of dienspan vanaf Gevorderde soektog. Dit gee hulle toegang, en Mense → Uitnodigings wys wie nog nie begin het nie, met Herinner.", "Mema abantu ku-Church & Trellis nge-imeyili noma nge-WhatsApp – umuntu oyedwa ekhasini lakhe, noma lonke iQembu Lokunakekela, iQembu Laphakathi Nesonto noma iqembu lokusebenza ku-Ukusesha Okuthuthukisiwe. Kubanika ukufinyelela, futhi u-Abantu → Izimemo ukhombisa ukuthi ubani ongakaqali, no-Khumbuza.", "Mema abantu kwi-Church & Trellis nge-imeyile okanye nge-WhatsApp – umntu omnye ukusuka kwiphepha lakhe, okanye lonke iQela loKhathalelo, iQela lePhakathi kweVeki okanye iqela lenkonzo ukusuka kuPhendlo oluPhambili. Kubanika ufikelelo, kwaye u-Abantu → Izimemo ubonisa ukuba ngubani ongekaqali, no-Khumbuza."],
    ["On an Android phone, Home now offers the Church & Trellis app – tap Get the app.", "Op ’n Android-foon bied Tuis nou die Church & Trellis-toep aan – tik op Kry die toep.", "Efonini ye-Android, iKhaya manje linikeza uhlelo lokusebenza lwe-Church & Trellis – thepha u-Thola uhlelo lokusebenza.", "Kwifowuni ye-Android, iKhaya ngoku linika usetyenziso lwe-Church & Trellis – cofa u-Fumana usetyenziso."],
    ["Say a name instead of typing it: tap the microphone in People’s search, or in any box where you look for someone. Names that sound like what you said come up too – tap the right one.", "Sê ’n naam in plaas daarvan om dit te tik: tik die mikrofoon in Mense se soektog, of in enige blokkie waar jy iemand soek. Name wat klink soos wat jy gesê het, verskyn ook – tik die regte een.", "Yisho igama esikhundleni sokulithayipha: thepha imakrofoni ekusesheni kwa-Abantu, noma kunoma yiliphi ibhokisi lapho ufuna khona umuntu. Amagama azwakala njengalokho okushilo nawo avela – thepha elifanele.", "Thetha igama endaweni yokulichwetheza: cofa imayikrofoni ekukhangeleni kwi-Abantu, okanye kuyo nayiphi na ibhokisi apho ukhangela umntu. Amagama avakala ngathi yile nto uyithethileyo nawo ayavela – cofa elichanekileyo."],
    ["Events: a whole paper sign-up sheet at once – open the event, tap From a sheet and take a photo. Church & Trellis reads the names and finds them in People; you check each one. Pastors and Administrators can register someone who isn’t in People yet.", "Geleenthede: ’n hele papier-inskrywingslys op een slag – maak die geleentheid oop, tik Van ’n lys af en neem ’n foto. Church & Trellis lees die name en vind hulle in Mense; jy kyk elkeen na. Pastore en Administrateurs kan iemand inskryf wat nog nie in Mense is nie.", "Imicimbi: iphepha lonke lokubhalisa ngesikhathi esisodwa – vula umcimbi, uthephe u-Kusuka ephepheni bese uthatha isithombe. I-Church & Trellis ifunda amagama futhi ibathole ku-Abantu; wena uhlola ngalinye. Abefundisi nabaLawuli bangabhalisa umuntu ongakabi ku-Abantu.", "Imisitho: iphepha lonke lokubhalisa ngaxeshanye – vula umsitho, ucofe u-Ukusuka ephepheni uze uthathe ifoto. I-Church & Trellis ifunda amagama ize ibafumane kwi-Abantu; wena ujonga nganye. Abefundisi nabaLawuli banokubhalisa umntu ongekabikho kwi-Abantu."],
    ["Visitor cards: People → From a photo reads the names (and any phone numbers and email addresses) and adds the new people as Attenders, after you check each one.", "Besoekerskaartjies: Mense → Van ’n foto af lees die name (en enige foonnommers en e-posadresse) en voeg die nuwe mense as Bywoners by, nadat jy elkeen nagegaan het.", "Amakhadi ezivakashi: Abantu → Kusuka esithombeni ifunda amagama (nanoma yiziphi izinombolo zocingo namakheli e-imeyili) bese yengeza abantu abasha njengabaHambela, ngemva kokuthi uhlole ngamunye.", "Amakhadi eendwendwe: Abantu → Ukusuka kwifoto ifunda amagama (nazo naziphi na iinombolo zefowuni needilesi ze-imeyile) ize yongeze abantu abatsha njengabaZimasi, emva kokuba ujonge nganye."],
    ["Looking for someone? Tap the microphone and say their name – even if it’s heard a little wrong, names that sound like it come up.", "Soek jy iemand? Tik die mikrofoon en sê hul naam – selfs as dit effens verkeerd gehoor word, verskyn name wat daarna klink.", "Ufuna umuntu? Thepha imakrofoni bese usho igama lakhe – ngisho noma lizwakala kancane ngendlela engafanele, amagama azwakala njengalo ayavela.", "Ukhangela umntu? Cofa imayikrofoni uze uthethe igama lakhe – nokuba livakala kancinci ngendlela engachanekanga, amagama avakala ngathi lilo ayavela."],
    ["Adding names from a sheet to an event: each person now has their own guests counter (filled in from “+2” on the sheet). Choose a photo also opens Google Photos on Android.", "Name van ’n lys by ’n geleentheid voeg: elke persoon het nou sy eie gastetel (ingevul uit “+2” op die lys). Kies ’n foto maak ook Google Photos op Android oop.", "Ukwengeza amagama asephepheni emcimbini: umuntu ngamunye manje unesibali sakhe sezivakashi (sigcwaliswa kusuka ku-“+2” ephepheni). U-Khetha isithombe uvula ne-Google Photos ku-Android.", "Ukongeza amagama asephepheni kumsitho: umntu ngamnye ngoku unesibali sakhe seendwendwe (sizaliswa ukusuka ku-“+2” ephepheni). U-Khetha ifoto uvula ne-Google Photos kwi-Android."],
    ["New: Help. Type or say a question about using Church & Trellis and get an answer written for you from the help pages – or browse them by topic.", "Nuut: Hulp. Tik of sê ’n vraag oor hoe om Church & Trellis te gebruik en kry ’n antwoord wat vir jou geskryf is uit die hulpbladsye – of blaai volgens onderwerp.", "Okusha: Usizo. Thayipha noma ukhulume umbuzo ngokusebenzisa i-Church & Trellis uthole impendulo ebhalelwe wena emakhasini osizo – noma uphequlule ngesihloko.", "Intsha: Uncedo. Chwetheza okanye uthethe umbuzo ngokusebenzisa i-Church & Trellis ufumane impendulo ebhalelwe wena kumaphepha oncedo – okanye ukhangele ngesihloko."],
    ["Not sure how to do something? Open Help, type or say your question, and get an answer written for you.", "Nie seker hoe om iets te doen nie? Maak Hulp oop, tik of sê jou vraag, en kry ’n antwoord wat vir jou geskryf is.", "Awuqiniseki ukuthi ungakwenza kanjani okuthile? Vula Usizo, thayipha noma ukhulume umbuzo wakho, uthole impendulo ebhalelwe wena.", "Awuqinisekanga ukuba ungayenza njani into? Vula Uncedo, chwetheza okanye uthethe umbuzo wakho, ufumane impendulo ebhalelwe wena."],
    ["Rosters has a tidier top: Print now has its own button, and the arrows and date for moving between Sundays sit just above the roster.", "Rosters het ’n netter bokant: Druk het nou sy eie knoppie, en die pyltjies en datum om tussen Sondae te beweeg is net bo die rooster.", "Uhlelo lunengaphezulu elihlelekile: iPhrinta manje inenkinobho yayo, kanti imicibisholo nosuku lokuhamba phakathi kwamaSonto kungaphezu nje kohlelo.", "Uludwe lunomphezulu ococekileyo: iPrinta ngoku ineqhosha layo, kwaye iintolo nomhla wokuhamba phakathi kweeCawa zingaphezulu koludwe."],
    ["Rosters: a position can now need a different number of people at each service – on Rosters → Teams choose the service (8am, 10am or 5pm) and tap − or +. The roster, the gaps and the printed roster follow it.", "Rosters: ’n posisie kan nou ’n ander getal mense by elke diens nodig hê – kies op Roosters → Spanne die diens (8vm, 10vm of 5nm) en tik − of +. Die rooster, die gapings en die gedrukte rooster volg dit.", "Ama-roster: isikhundla manje singadinga inani elihlukile labantu enkonzweni ngayinye – ku-Rosters → Teams khetha inkonzo (8am, 10am noma 5pm) bese uthinta − noma +. I-roster, ubumbi kanye ne-roster eshicilelwe kuyalandela.", "Ii-roster: isikhundla ngoku sinokufuna inani eliyahlukileyo labantu kwinkonzo nganye – kwi-Rosters → Teams khetha inkonzo (8am, 10am okanye 5pm) uze ucofe − okanye +. I-roster, izikhewu kunye ne-roster eprintiweyo ziyalandela."],
    ["Rosters: a service that is cancelled keeps a narrow column on the roster – on screen, on paper and in the PDF – with the note written up its side. Tap ⋯ under its date → Cancel this service…; everyone on it stays on the roster, can be sent a friendly message, and comes back when you put the service back.", "Rooster: ’n diens wat gekanselleer is, hou ’n smal kolom op die rooster – op die skerm, op papier en in die PDF – met die nota langs sy kant geskryf. Tik ⋯ onder sy datum → Kanselleer hierdie diens…; almal daarop bly op die rooster, kan ’n vriendelike boodskap kry, en kom terug as jy die diens terugsit.", "Uhlelo: inkonzo ekhanseliwe igcina ikholomu emincane ohlwini – esikrinini, ephepheni nakwi-PDF – nenothi elibhalwe eceleni kwayo. Thinta ⋯ ngezansi kwosuku lwayo → Khansela le nkonzo…; wonke umuntu okuyo uhlala ohlwini, angathola umyalezo onobungane, futhi abuye uma ubuyisa inkonzo.", "Uluhlu: inkonzo erhoxisiweyo igcina ikholam encinci kuluhlu – kwisikrini,ephepheni nakwi-PDF – kunye nenqaku elibhalwe ecaleni kwayo. Cofa ⋯ phantsi komhla wayo → Rhoxisa le nkonzo…; wonke umntu okuyo uhlala kuluhlu, angafumana umyalezo onobubele, aze abuye xa ubuyisela inkonzo."],
    ["If a service you were rostered on is cancelled, Me → Serving now says Cancelled (and you may get a friendly message), and the printed roster keeps a narrow column for it.", "As ’n diens waarop jy op die rooster was gekanselleer word, sê Ek → Dien nou Gekanselleer (en jy kan ’n vriendelike boodskap kry), en die gedrukte rooster hou ’n smal kolom daarvoor.", "Uma inkonzo obukuyo ohlwini ikhanselwa, Mina → Ukukhonza manje kuthi Kukhanselwe (futhi ungathola umyalezo onobungane), futhi uhlelo oluphrintiwe lugcina ikholomu emincane yayo.", "Ukuba inkonzo obukuluhlu kuyo irhoxisiwe, Mna → Ukukhonza ngoku kuthi Kurhoxisiwe (kwaye unokufumana umyalezo onobubele), kwaye uluhlu oluprintiweyo lugcina ikholam encinci yayo."],
    ["Service cancelled? Don’t delete it: tap ⋯ under its date on Rosters and choose Cancel this service… – the roster keeps a narrow column for it, and you can tell everyone on it kindly.", "Diens gekanselleer? Moenie dit skrap nie: tik ⋯ onder sy datum op Rooster en kies Kanselleer hierdie diens… – die rooster hou ’n smal kolom daarvoor, en jy kan almal daarop vriendelik laat weet.", "Inkonzo ikhanseliwe? Ungayisusi: thinta ⋯ ngezansi kosuku lwayo ku-Uhlelo bese ukhetha Khansela le nkonzo… – uhlelo lugcina ikholomu emincane, futhi ungazisa wonke umuntu okuyo ngomusa.", "Inkonzo irhoxisiwe? Ungayisusi: cofa ⋯ phantsi komhla wayo kuLuhlu uze ukhethe Rhoxisa le nkonzo… – uluhlu lugcina ikholam encinci, kwaye ungawazisa onke abantu abakuyo ngobubele."],
    ["Birthdays and wedding anniversaries now get a little celebration: on your own day you see a card on Home and Me, and 🎂 or 💍 appears beside a name wherever the church already shows that date.", "Verjaarsdae en huweliksherdenkings word nou ’n bietjie gevier: op jou eie dag sien jy ’n kaart op Tuis en Ek, en 🎂 of 💍 verskyn langs ’n naam waar die kerk dié datum reeds wys.", "Izinsuku zokuzalwa nezomshado manje ziyagujwa kancane: ngosuku lwakho ubona ikhadi ku-Ekhaya naku-Mina, futhi u-🎂 noma u-💍 uvela eduze kwegama lapho ibandla selivele lilibonisa khona leso sikhathi.", "Imihla yokuzalwa neyomtshato ngoku iyabhiyozelwa kancinane: ngomhla wakho uyabona ikhadi kwi-Ekhaya nakwi-Mna, kwaye u-🎂 okanye u-💍 uvela ecaleni kwegama apho icawe sele ibonisa khona loo mhla."],
    ["When something is missing on a person’s details, Church & Trellis now takes you straight to that box, with the problem shown right under it.", "As iets op ’n persoon se besonderhede ontbreek, neem Church & Trellis jou nou reguit na daardie blokkie, met die probleem net daaronder aangetoon.", "Uma kunokuthile okungekho emininingwaneni yomuntu, i-Church & Trellis manje ikuyisa ngqo ebhokisini elinjalo, inkinga ibonakala ngaphansi kwalo.", "Ukuba kukho into engekhoyo kwiinkcukacha zomntu, i-Church & Trellis ngoku ikuse ngqo kwibhokisi leyo, ingxaki ibonakala ngaphantsi kwayo."],
    ["When you change someone’s home address, Church & Trellis now offers the same address to their husband or wife. People also lists married couples whose addresses don’t match, so they can be put right.", "Wanneer jy iemand se huisadres verander, bied Church & Trellis nou dieselfde adres aan hulle man of vrou aan. Mense lys ook getroude paartjies wie se adresse nie ooreenstem nie, sodat dit reggemaak kan word.", "Uma ushintsha ikheli lomuntu lasekhaya, i-Church & Trellis manje iyabuncoma ikheli elifanayo kumyeni noma kunkosikazi wakhe. Abantu futhi kuhlu abashadile amakheli abo angafani, ukuze alungiswe.", "Xa utshintsha idilesi yomntu yasekhaya, i-Church & Trellis ngoku ibonelela ngedilesi efanayo kwindoda okanye kumfazi wakhe. Abantu bachaza kwakhona abantu abatshatileyo iidilesi zabo zingafani, ukuze zilungiswe."],
    ["A married or partnered person’s page now says when their address is different from their spouse’s or partner’s.", "’n Getroude of lewensmaat-persoon se bladsy sê nou wanneer hul adres verskil van dié van hul eggenoot of lewensmaat.", "Ikhasi lomuntu oshadile noma onomlingani manje lithi uma ikheli lakhe lihlukile kweleyo mshade naye noma kwelomlingani wakhe.", "Iphepha lomntu otshatileyo okanye onqabane ngoku lithi xa idilesi yakhe yahlukile kweyeqabane lakhe lomtshato okanye iqabane."],
    ["Couples who aren’t married (partners) are now checked too, and you can always choose Keep both addresses when two people should have different ones.", "Paartjies wat nie getroud is nie (lewensmaats) word nou ook nagegaan, en jy kan altyd Hou albei adresse kies wanneer twee mense verskillende adresse moet hê.", "Izibalo ezingashadile (abalingani) manje nazo ziyahlolwa, futhi ungakhetha njalo Gcina womabili amakheli uma abantu ababili kufanele babe namakheli ahlukene.", "Izibini ezingatshatanga (amaqabane) ngoku nazo ziyahlolwa, kwaye unokukhetha rhoqo Gcina zozibini iidilesi xa abantu ababini kufuneka babe needilesi ezahlukeneyo."],
    ["Administrators now have a Church health card on Home: a short list of things worth a look in the church’s records, such as people who can’t be reached, groups without a leader or roster turns held by people who have left.", "Administrateurs het nou ’n Kerkgesondheid-kaart op Tuis: ’n kort lys van dinge in die kerk se rekords wat die moeite werd is om na te kyk, soos mense wat nie bereik kan word nie, groepe sonder ’n leier of rosterbeurte wat deur mense gehou word wat weg is.", "Abaphathi manje banekhadi le-Impilo yebandla ekhasini lokuqala: uhlu olufushane lwezinto ezifanele ukubhekwa emarekhodini ebandla, njengabantu abangenakuthintwa, amaqembu angenamholi noma amathuba ohlelo abanjwe abantu abahambile.", "Abalawuli ngoku banekhadi le-Impilo yebandla kwiphepha lokuqala: uluhlu olufutshane lweento ezifanele ukujongwa kwimirhumo yebandla, ezifana nabantu abangenakufikelelwa, amaqela angenamkhokheli okanye amathuba osuku abanjwe ngabantu abasukileyo."],
    ["Buttons now press down a little when you tap them.", "Knoppies druk nou ’n bietjie in wanneer jy dit aanraak.", "Izinkinobho manje ziyacindezeleka kancane uma uzithinta.", "Iiqhosha ngoku ziyacinezeleka kancinane xa uzichukumisa."],
    ["Church Partners now see 🎂 or 💍 beside someone’s name in the church directory on their birthday or wedding anniversary (the day only). Don’t want yours shown? Turn it off on Me → My details.", "Kerkvennote sien nou 🎂 of 💍 langs iemand se naam in die kerkgids op hul verjaarsdag of huweliksherdenking (net die dag). Wil jy nie hê joune moet wys nie? Skakel dit af op Ek → My besonderhede.", "Abalingani beBandla manje babona u-🎂 noma u-💍 eduze kwegama lomuntu ohlwini lwebandla ngosuku lwakhe lokuzalwa noma lomshado (usuku kuphela). Awufuni okwakho kuboniswe? Kuvale ku-Mina → Imininingwane yami.", "Amaqabane eCawe ngoku abona u-🎂 okanye u-💍 ecaleni kwegama lomntu kuluhlu lwecawe ngomhla wakhe wokuzalwa okanye womtshato (umhla kuphela). Akufuni owakho uboniswe? Wucime kwi-Mna → Iinkcukacha zam."],
    ["Pastors, carers and Midweek Group leaders now see Birthdays this week on Home. Pastors also see who may have a hard day, on the anniversary of a husband’s or wife’s death.", "Pastore, versorgers en Midweekgroepleiers sien nou Verjaarsdae hierdie week op Tuis. Pastore sien ook wie dalk ’n moeilike dag het, op die herdenking van ’n man of vrou se dood.", "AbeFundisi, abanakekeli nabaholi bamaQembu aPhakathi Nesonto manje babona Izinsuku zokuzalwa kuleli sonto ku-Ekhaya. AbeFundisi babona nalabo abangaba nosuku olunzima, ngosuku lokukhumbula ukufa komyeni noma unkosikazi.", "AbaFundisi, abakhathaleli neenkokeli zamaQela aPhakathi Evekini ngoku babona Imihla yokuzalwa kule veki kwi-Ekhaya. AbaFundisi babona nabo banokuba nomhla onzima, ngomhla wokukhumbula ukufa kwendoda okanye umfazi."],
]);
